1
00:02:03,264 --> 00:02:12,134
Contact: turkision@gmail.com

2
00:02:13,126 --> 00:02:15,685
﻿Thanks, brother.

3
00:02:16,326 --> 00:02:19,245
﻿Well, Ahmet Bey... As we talked.

4
00:02:19,246 --> 00:02:22,045
Nothing should be deficient.

5
00:02:22,206 --> 00:02:25,405
﻿We ordered 2000 pitchers.

6
00:02:25,406 --> 00:02:28,045
﻿-Right? Well..
-Yes.

7
00:02:28,126 --> 00:02:31,805
﻿Some may be broken on
the way. Load some more.

8
00:02:31,846 --> 00:02:35,245
﻿-I can pay for them.
-As you order, Ayhan Agha.

9
00:02:35,566 --> 00:02:38,165
﻿Work never waits then.
I should go.

10
00:02:38,286 --> 00:02:41,565
﻿You can go. Stay safe.

11
00:03:37,176 --> 00:03:41,205
﻿Beys, welcome. Do you have any wishes?

12
00:03:41,406 --> 00:03:45,125
﻿-Do you cook human flesh, innkeeper?
-Oh my...

13
00:03:47,926 --> 00:03:50,005
﻿Bring lamb for each of us.

14
00:03:50,126 --> 00:03:51,885
﻿I don't have that much.

15
00:03:51,926 --> 00:03:55,445
-Bring whatever you have then.
-Of course my Bey.

16
00:03:58,006 --> 00:04:02,485
﻿That's true. Mongolians tried
to take Osman Bey captive.

17
00:04:02,686 --> 00:04:05,605
﻿-And they lost their heads.
-What was his name?

18
00:04:05,606 --> 00:04:09,245
﻿Akcelasun or whatever. Their commander.

19
00:04:09,366 --> 00:04:12,805
﻿He threw that dog's head to Yakup Bey's feet.

20
00:04:13,006 --> 00:04:17,685
﻿Did the boys also play with the head, ha?

21
00:04:20,446 --> 00:04:23,805
﻿We shouldn't let even their
heads touch our feet, brother.

22
00:04:23,806 --> 00:04:26,365
﻿They probably showed
the head around on a spear.

23
00:04:26,526 --> 00:04:31,765
﻿I wish we had been there. So
we could have killed some nokers.

24
00:04:33,966 --> 00:04:39,085
﻿Warriors, why do you talk the dead's behind?

25
00:04:39,326 --> 00:04:43,605
﻿Even in the dinner table?
They are just dead now.

26
00:04:44,006 --> 00:04:46,925
﻿Just eat your food quietly.

27
00:04:47,606 --> 00:04:51,085
﻿-You are doing wrong.
-We miss slaughtering Mongolians.

28
00:04:51,126 --> 00:04:55,045
﻿They tortured us a lot. We want battle!

29
00:04:55,366 --> 00:04:58,445
﻿Do you want to kill Mongolians so bad?

30
00:04:59,926 --> 00:05:02,685
﻿We really do.

31
00:05:03,246 --> 00:05:07,605
﻿-We pray for it every time.
-You have good hearts.

32
00:05:13,366 --> 00:05:17,605
﻿Great Mergen, make them hear Erlik Khan.

33
00:05:25,646 --> 00:05:29,965
﻿They are the men we were
expecting. They'll stir up a big trouble.

34
00:05:30,126 --> 00:05:34,045
-Be ready.
-Things will go crazy, Master Gera.

35
00:05:53,806 --> 00:05:56,525
﻿Mongolians!

36
00:06:57,326 --> 00:07:00,005
Spare him.

37
00:07:25,246 --> 00:07:29,365
﻿You wanted to slaughter Mongolians.

38
00:07:29,606 --> 00:07:32,645
Tengri (Turkish-Mongolian God) heard you.

39
00:07:36,446 --> 00:07:39,685
﻿I'm Karacelasun.

40
00:07:39,926 --> 00:07:42,885
﻿I came to avenge my brother.

41
00:07:43,006 --> 00:07:46,765
﻿Just be careful.

42
00:07:47,406 --> 00:07:52,085
We are their master.
Nobody can stand against us.

43
00:07:52,326 --> 00:07:54,725
﻿Just hear me.

44
00:07:55,566 --> 00:07:58,765
﻿The arrow to touch you will burn my heart.

45
00:07:58,926 --> 00:08:03,605
﻿You are my only precious in this
world. We are one body, brother.

46
00:08:04,086 --> 00:08:09,165
﻿We are. Our parents are the same.
We were born at the same time.

47
00:08:09,606 --> 00:08:14,965
﻿I have brother to ruin their
world if something happens to me.

48
00:08:15,206 --> 00:08:17,565
﻿I'm not worried.

49
00:08:22,286 --> 00:08:26,285
﻿I swear I'll ruin their world, brother.

50
00:08:26,446 --> 00:08:28,645
﻿My brother.

51
00:08:57,206 --> 00:09:00,925
﻿Show me the enemies around.

52
00:09:01,526 --> 00:09:05,125
﻿My Bey, Mongolians in the east.

53
00:09:05,326 --> 00:09:08,525
﻿They've surrounded our borders.

54
00:09:09,126 --> 00:09:13,885
﻿They must have taken action after
the moves we made against them.

55
00:09:14,566 --> 00:09:17,085
﻿What else?

56
00:09:18,086 --> 00:09:23,565
﻿Byzantine in the west. To attack,
they are waiting for us to stumble.

57
00:09:23,886 --> 00:09:28,285
﻿They won't stop either. We
took their castles from them.

58
00:09:28,886 --> 00:09:32,885
﻿-What else?
-My Bey.

59
00:09:33,286 --> 00:09:36,285
﻿This spot is the land of Germiyan.

60
00:09:36,526 --> 00:09:40,845
﻿Since we canceled our loyalty,
they've seen us as an enemy.

61
00:09:41,246 --> 00:09:44,685
﻿They are just rivals not enemy, Bayindir Bey.

62
00:09:45,206 --> 00:09:49,045
﻿Muslims should never be
enemies against each other.

63
00:09:49,926 --> 00:09:55,325
﻿If they fall into carelessness,
they can be enemies, son.

64
00:10:01,486 --> 00:10:07,805
﻿If they convince the beys and
show us as the enemy against them,

65
00:10:08,246 --> 00:10:11,485
﻿...in this huge sea you see,

66
00:10:11,686 --> 00:10:15,045
﻿...we will remain like a small boat.

67
00:10:17,366 --> 00:10:22,525
﻿You always say those on the right
way are always alone and on their own.

68
00:10:22,886 --> 00:10:26,285
﻿Yes, they are.

69
00:10:26,766 --> 00:10:31,285
﻿Now show me another enemy.

70
00:10:45,766 --> 00:10:48,605
﻿Traitors among us.

71
00:10:50,086 --> 00:10:54,765
﻿Those who look like
friends to us and our land.

72
00:10:56,046 --> 00:11:00,205
﻿As you see, we are stuck here.

73
00:11:00,766 --> 00:11:04,885
﻿We are just like a wounded wolf.

74
00:11:07,486 --> 00:11:12,125
﻿The wounded wolf has nothing to
lose, my Bey. He attacks for his life.

75
00:11:12,566 --> 00:11:16,805
﻿So will we. We will attack.

76
00:11:18,126 --> 00:11:20,405
﻿-Bayindir.
-My Bey.

77
00:11:20,606 --> 00:11:24,285
﻿You will never get off the
tails of the traitors among us.

78
00:11:24,926 --> 00:11:29,445
﻿You have been after Ayhan Agha for long.
But you could find nothing. Speak now.

79
00:11:29,766 --> 00:11:33,605
﻿My Bey, Ayhan Agha has
been managing to get rid of me.

80
00:11:33,846 --> 00:11:38,805
﻿We got rid of me in Sogut
lastly. But I know where to start.

81
00:11:39,206 --> 00:11:42,925
﻿With Allah's will, I will find.

82
00:11:43,206 --> 00:11:46,445
Thank you, thank you.

83
00:11:47,326 --> 00:11:48,725
﻿-Boran.
-My Bey.

84
00:11:48,766 --> 00:11:52,005
﻿Increase the numbers of
patrols against Mongolians.

85
00:11:52,006 --> 00:11:56,005
﻿If an army comes, we should
know and attack accordingly.

86
00:11:56,406 --> 00:11:59,245
﻿-As you order, my Bey.
-Sons.

87
00:11:59,246 --> 00:12:02,645
﻿-My Bey.
-You two will go to the frontier market.

88
00:12:02,686 --> 00:12:06,925
﻿Keep your eyes on the
house of Germiyan all the time.

89
00:12:07,406 --> 00:12:10,485
﻿-As you order, my Bey.
-We will be hard on them, my Bey.

90
00:12:10,766 --> 00:12:13,245
Thank you.

91
00:12:13,886 --> 00:12:17,285
﻿We won't stop, but continue the conquests.

92
00:12:17,526 --> 00:12:22,285
﻿We will attack Byzantine so
they won't be able to try to rise.

93
00:12:24,166 --> 00:12:28,605
﻿Konur, go to the headquarters at dawn.

94
00:12:28,806 --> 00:12:32,925
﻿Take the Bannerless with
you. Start the preparations.

95
00:12:33,166 --> 00:12:36,205
﻿As you order, my Bey.

96
00:12:37,766 --> 00:12:42,205
﻿We will see who stands beside us...

97
00:12:42,246 --> 00:12:44,805
﻿...and who doesn't.

98
00:12:46,166 --> 00:12:52,045
We fight for Allah's
consent not for human desire.

99
00:12:54,206 --> 00:12:56,085
﻿May Allah bless our fight.

100
00:12:56,286 --> 00:13:00,085
﻿-Aameen, my Bey.
-Aameen.

101
00:13:05,846 --> 00:13:09,805
﻿Turkish soldiers are standing
in the yard, Karacelasun.

102
00:13:16,726 --> 00:13:20,525
﻿-Who are you?
-I'm a merchant.

103
00:13:21,286 --> 00:13:24,445
﻿That's what everybody thinks I am.

104
00:13:50,366 --> 00:13:52,605
﻿Do not lie to me.

105
00:13:52,606 --> 00:13:56,125
﻿My brother died because of your lies.

106
00:13:58,206 --> 00:14:02,285
﻿I am his executioner. You
knew we were mongols.

107
00:14:02,566 --> 00:14:05,925
﻿You foresee the trouble.

108
00:14:06,206 --> 00:14:10,405
﻿Who are you?

109
00:14:14,286 --> 00:14:18,325
﻿I am above you all, mongol.

110
00:14:18,406 --> 00:14:21,485
﻿I am the mighty Rome.

111
00:14:21,726 --> 00:14:25,165
﻿-Is that so?
-Yes.

112
00:14:26,046 --> 00:14:29,125
﻿I know you came for vengeance.

113
00:14:29,406 --> 00:14:33,085
﻿I was waiting for you.

114
00:14:33,526 --> 00:14:36,485
﻿Karacelasun.

115
00:14:37,886 --> 00:14:43,525
﻿We either die together or fight together.

116
00:14:44,486 --> 00:14:48,645
﻿We want the same heads, crusader.

117
00:14:51,886 --> 00:14:58,965
﻿-I am glad to hear that.
-You're just glad being alive.

118
00:15:00,046 --> 00:15:05,565
﻿You will give me your expert
soldiers. They will now how to hide.

119
00:15:05,646 --> 00:15:09,645
﻿My men are excellent fighters.

120
00:15:09,966 --> 00:15:15,605
﻿They are also very good at hiding.

121
00:15:28,406 --> 00:15:31,605
﻿Now you will tell me.

122
00:15:31,766 --> 00:15:38,605
﻿Where can I hit Osman,
Yakup, beys and their loved ones.

123
00:15:40,166 --> 00:15:44,685
﻿I will tell you with pleasure.

124
00:15:44,846 --> 00:15:50,565
﻿Where you will hit Osman and his loved ones.

125
00:15:54,446 --> 00:16:00,285
﻿Ladies sent word, there are some
potential brides at frontier marketplace.

126
00:16:00,446 --> 00:16:04,125
﻿Let us see them first thing in the morning.

127
00:16:04,566 --> 00:16:10,565
﻿Our sons have fallen for different people.
I don't know if what we do is alright.

128
00:16:12,086 --> 00:16:15,485
﻿I know Bala, I know. However..

129
00:16:15,606 --> 00:16:19,325
﻿Holofira can't be a bride
to us. You also know this.

130
00:16:19,406 --> 00:16:22,965
﻿She can not handle this state
dream. Her religion is different.

131
00:16:23,046 --> 00:16:27,245
﻿She is also very religious. She
grew up in palaces, she is fragile.

132
00:16:27,326 --> 00:16:32,005
﻿-She can not handle our load.
-Of course she can’t.

133
00:16:32,886 --> 00:16:38,005
﻿What about Orhan? What if he
oppose this, what will we do then?

134
00:16:38,126 --> 00:16:42,125
﻿My Orhan won't stand
against her mother for a girl.

135
00:16:42,246 --> 00:16:46,645
﻿-However, it will be hard.
-Of course it will be hard.

136
00:16:46,686 --> 00:16:49,605
﻿Love is the greatest feeling
our Rabb has granted to us.

137
00:16:49,686 --> 00:16:52,885
﻿However, our sons can
not show weakness to that.

138
00:16:53,046 --> 00:16:57,125
﻿What is important is the state,
Orhan will understand this as well.

139
00:16:57,366 --> 00:17:01,765
﻿However, my brother
wants it, mother. I can see it.

140
00:17:01,966 --> 00:17:05,723
﻿My brother is in love
with Holofira very much.

141
00:17:05,886 --> 00:17:11,723
﻿Love is important my daughter.
But state is more important.

142
00:17:11,806 --> 00:17:16,685
﻿I know Orhan. We will
find a suitable bride for sure.

143
00:17:16,806 --> 00:17:22,925
﻿Mother Bala, do you also not
want Gonca Hatun as a bride?

144
00:17:23,046 --> 00:17:26,405
﻿Gonca? To Alaeddin?

145
00:17:26,486 --> 00:17:30,565
﻿I was going to tell you that. I believe..

146
00:17:30,646 --> 00:17:35,045
﻿Alaeddin and Gonca loves each other.

147
00:17:35,126 --> 00:17:38,285
﻿However, Mother Bala
does not trust Saadet Hatun.

148
00:17:38,446 --> 00:17:41,085
﻿Of course Saadet can
not be trusted, however..

149
00:17:41,246 --> 00:17:46,005
﻿Gonca is a good girl. What will you do?

150
00:17:46,086 --> 00:17:48,605
﻿For now, I will observe.

151
00:17:48,726 --> 00:17:51,805
﻿If they really love each other..

152
00:17:51,926 --> 00:17:56,885
﻿Then I won't stand against them.
Of course there would be a way.

153
00:17:57,286 --> 00:17:59,965
﻿Let me go and check my brothers.

154
00:18:00,046 --> 00:18:04,165
﻿It seems they have a lot
more to worry about, a lot.

155
00:18:05,926 --> 00:18:10,405
﻿Quickly my daughter, you can go.

156
00:18:49,526 --> 00:18:53,085
﻿My brothers, you are sleepwalking.

157
00:18:53,246 --> 00:18:56,165
﻿Did you say something sister?

158
00:18:56,446 --> 00:18:59,925
﻿I'm saying, a while back..

159
00:19:00,126 --> 00:19:05,725
﻿While you are not at the palace. I
caught Gonca Hatun at your room.

160
00:19:07,086 --> 00:19:09,325
﻿She was looking for a room so to say.

161
00:19:09,406 --> 00:19:12,565
﻿You are always under
these kind of situations, sister.

162
00:19:12,606 --> 00:19:14,885
﻿You also told my mother about Gonca, right?

163
00:19:14,966 --> 00:19:19,965
﻿Are you going to deny it? I
know how you look at her, brother.

164
00:19:21,166 --> 00:19:25,205
﻿Fatma is right. Alaeddin..

165
00:19:25,286 --> 00:19:28,725
﻿Can you not tell me as well? So brother?

166
00:19:28,806 --> 00:19:31,965
﻿Look at me.

167
00:19:32,446 --> 00:19:36,205
﻿Are you really..

168
00:19:37,726 --> 00:19:42,445
﻿It will stay between us though do you swear?

169
00:19:42,526 --> 00:19:46,885
﻿I won't tell anyone. However, Fatma..

170
00:19:46,966 --> 00:19:49,685
﻿-I can not trust much.

171
00:19:49,846 --> 00:19:52,565
﻿Really brother?

172
00:19:52,646 --> 00:19:55,605
﻿Really? When did I do such a thing?

173
00:19:55,686 --> 00:20:01,205
﻿You never did something like that.
Do you ever do something like that?

174
00:20:07,246 --> 00:20:12,205
﻿Look here. How he has become
after hearing hatuns name.

175
00:20:12,726 --> 00:20:16,605
﻿He is already in love.

176
00:20:18,166 --> 00:20:23,525
﻿My heart and my mind
tells different things, brother.

177
00:20:24,246 --> 00:20:27,845
﻿Brother, this is love.

178
00:20:28,446 --> 00:20:33,125
﻿You will hear your heart, not your mind.

179
00:20:33,566 --> 00:20:40,445
﻿Now tell me. Do you love this Gonca Hatun?

180
00:20:41,926 --> 00:20:45,325
﻿Come on brother.

181
00:20:46,206 --> 00:20:48,805
﻿If you ask about my heart..

182
00:20:52,646 --> 00:20:55,845
﻿I do.

183
00:20:56,246 --> 00:20:58,805
﻿However, if you ask about my mind..

184
00:20:58,886 --> 00:21:01,565
﻿When we talk about love..

185
00:21:02,126 --> 00:21:05,605
﻿Mind is nothing but a tool.

186
00:21:05,726 --> 00:21:08,885
﻿I got my answer.

187
00:21:09,046 --> 00:21:11,245
-Thank you.
-Don't..

188
00:21:11,406 --> 00:21:14,485
﻿Do not do it like my brother Orhan.

189
00:21:14,646 --> 00:21:17,845
﻿-What does it mean?
-Look here.

190
00:21:17,966 --> 00:21:21,085
﻿What about me?

191
00:21:21,886 --> 00:21:27,965
﻿Even the newborn babies will
know about my love to Holofira.

192
00:21:28,086 --> 00:21:31,445
﻿Tomorrow..

193
00:21:32,446 --> 00:21:36,485
﻿I will propose to Holofira.

194
00:21:39,446 --> 00:21:42,605
﻿What are you saying, brother?

195
00:21:45,806 --> 00:21:49,285
﻿It fits to my brother!

196
00:21:50,846 --> 00:21:55,725
﻿Tell me. When will you talk to Gonca Hatun?

197
00:21:56,606 --> 00:22:00,525
﻿-Brother.
-You need to be quick.

198
00:22:00,646 --> 00:22:04,965
﻿Or you will have to marry
with whoever our mothers find.

199
00:22:06,126 --> 00:22:10,005
﻿Look, you've heard Fatma.

200
00:22:17,006 --> 00:22:20,645
﻿First, I need to be sure about Gonca.

201
00:22:21,366 --> 00:22:24,365
﻿GERM1YANOGLU S1N1R1 / PAZAR

202
00:22:24,566 --> 00:22:27,285
﻿Osman Bey says...

203
00:22:27,366 --> 00:22:32,525
﻿...the one who is under a
shadow cannot have a shadow.

204
00:22:34,166 --> 00:22:38,085
﻿He took his allegiance back.

205
00:22:39,766 --> 00:22:45,325
﻿He doesn't know that when one is
not under the shadow of Germiyan...

206
00:22:45,406 --> 00:22:51,445
﻿...let alone growing, he cannot even survive.

207
00:22:52,446 --> 00:22:58,365
﻿Let Mongols slap them
first, let Byzantine hurt them...

208
00:22:58,446 --> 00:23:01,205
﻿Then he will understand.

209
00:23:01,806 --> 00:23:05,965
﻿It will happen, Mehmet. All
of those things will happen.

210
00:23:06,086 --> 00:23:10,325
﻿Once they hear that he left us...

211
00:23:10,446 --> 00:23:15,125
﻿...they will start attacking
them like mad dogs.

212
00:23:23,166 --> 00:23:25,485
﻿Don't you dare...

213
00:23:26,366 --> 00:23:28,925
﻿No one will show mercy.

214
00:23:29,606 --> 00:23:33,565
﻿No one will pity on them.

215
00:23:33,886 --> 00:23:38,405
﻿We cannot show mercy on traitors, my Bey.

216
00:23:40,646 --> 00:23:43,845
﻿Don't worry.

217
00:23:46,046 --> 00:23:51,245
﻿Mehmet! Inform the Bannerless.

218
00:23:51,406 --> 00:23:56,725
﻿Osman will want them as well
now. They must wait for the right time.

219
00:23:57,046 --> 00:24:01,325
We will weaken Osman well enough first.

220
00:24:01,406 --> 00:24:04,205
﻿Yes father.

221
00:24:06,406 --> 00:24:11,165
﻿-Kanyumaz! -My Sultan.
-Send messengers.

222
00:24:11,246 --> 00:24:13,445
﻿I want all Beys to visit me.

223
00:24:13,526 --> 00:24:18,805
﻿They will all arrive in the frontiers
marketplace as soon as possible, my Sultan.

224
00:24:26,206 --> 00:24:30,325
﻿Not in the frontiers marketplace, Kanyumaz.

225
00:24:32,766 --> 00:24:35,205
﻿I want all Beys...

226
00:24:35,366 --> 00:24:39,725
﻿...to come to Kutahya, to my palace.

227
00:24:41,046 --> 00:24:46,165
﻿I will want them to present their submission.

228
00:24:46,606 --> 00:24:51,885
﻿I will not let them disappoint
me like Osman did.

229
00:24:55,566 --> 00:24:59,165
﻿Therefore, they will see me in my palace...

230
00:24:59,286 --> 00:25:03,125
﻿...with all my strength.

231
00:26:47,446 --> 00:26:52,405
﻿Attacking Kite is not a good move, Konur Bey.

232
00:26:53,326 --> 00:26:56,245
﻿If we are going to attack...

233
00:26:57,006 --> 00:27:00,525
﻿...we must attack villages nearby first.

234
00:27:00,726 --> 00:27:03,485
﻿We must plunder there.

235
00:27:03,726 --> 00:27:06,325
﻿We are not plunderers, Demir Boga (ironbull).

236
00:27:06,406 --> 00:27:12,245
﻿We are fighting for its people to be
treated with our justice and find peace.

237
00:27:12,726 --> 00:27:15,885
﻿Trying to attack Kite while
they are waiting for us...

238
00:27:16,006 --> 00:27:18,525
﻿...will put our lives in danger, Konur Bey.

239
00:27:18,806 --> 00:27:20,595
﻿Let's walk to Atranos.

240
00:27:20,607 --> 00:27:22,565
GurDogan. (Strong Hawk)

241
00:27:23,446 --> 00:27:27,165
﻿Look...
Look at Atranos' roads.

242
00:27:27,326 --> 00:27:32,845
﻿Walking to Atranos before
taking Kite means killing our men.

243
00:27:36,166 --> 00:27:40,205
﻿When the soldiers of Kite
come to Atranos to help...

244
00:27:40,366 --> 00:27:43,605
﻿...these rocks will be our graves.

245
00:27:47,526 --> 00:27:51,605
﻿It is our duty to plan the moves for a fight.

246
00:27:51,726 --> 00:27:56,365
﻿We are not raiding caravans. Know your place.

247
00:27:58,446 --> 00:28:01,725
﻿Osman Bey is coming!

248
00:28:03,166 --> 00:28:07,765
﻿We will walk to Kite. Prepare the Bannerless.

249
00:28:18,406 --> 00:28:23,885
﻿Gurdogan... How long are
we going to obey them, huh?

250
00:28:24,286 --> 00:28:28,805
﻿Look at the situation we are in
on the way we set out for freedom.

251
00:28:29,086 --> 00:28:32,045
﻿We will turn our backs on them...

252
00:28:32,206 --> 00:28:35,605
﻿...in their hardest times...

253
00:28:35,766 --> 00:28:38,805
﻿...when they need us the most.

254
00:28:38,886 --> 00:28:40,885
﻿Konur, are the preparations all done?

255
00:28:40,966 --> 00:28:44,405
﻿Tell me what you did.
-Everything is ready, my Bey.

256
00:29:13,846 --> 00:29:15,965
﻿Where are you going?

257
00:29:27,246 --> 00:29:29,805
﻿Ya Allah!

258
00:29:30,046 --> 00:29:34,565
We never let bandits step on our lands!

259
00:30:06,246 --> 00:30:10,125
﻿A little man with such bravery, huh?

260
00:30:10,286 --> 00:30:13,845
﻿But you have no bravery...
Come!

261
00:30:28,086 --> 00:30:30,885
﻿Gurbuz! Brother!

262
00:30:32,086 --> 00:30:35,205
﻿Hasan!
Save Gurbuz!

263
00:30:35,806 --> 00:30:38,005
﻿Gurbuz!

264
00:30:38,566 --> 00:30:41,685
﻿Do I have to crush your skull now...

265
00:30:41,766 --> 00:30:45,965
﻿..or should I drink your blood?

266
00:30:49,326 --> 00:30:53,045
﻿Alps! We are going back! Come on!

267
00:30:56,686 --> 00:31:01,045
﻿I will come for you all!

268
00:31:01,646 --> 00:31:04,645
GERMIYANOGULLARI BORDER
BORDER MARKET

269
00:31:31,846 --> 00:31:35,285
﻿Welcome, Malhun Hatun.
-Thank you.

270
00:31:35,366 --> 00:31:38,405
﻿All bride-to-be girls are in the marketplace.

271
00:31:38,766 --> 00:31:42,285
﻿Let me see them from a distance first.

272
00:31:46,246 --> 00:31:50,325
﻿My son... Where is Orhan?

273
00:31:50,566 --> 00:31:53,045
﻿I don't know,
Malhun mother.

274
00:31:53,526 --> 00:31:57,485
﻿Don’t you know? My brother...

275
00:32:02,046 --> 00:32:06,765
﻿What happened? Are you
hiding something from me?

276
00:32:11,886 --> 00:32:15,245
﻿Did Orhan...
-He will come.

277
00:32:15,366 --> 00:32:18,165
﻿He must be busy right now.

278
00:32:21,086 --> 00:32:26,005
﻿Let's see the girls first, then he
can come and meet them, huh?

279
00:32:53,366 --> 00:32:59,045
I cannot silence myself,
brother. Isn't there a cure for that?

280
00:32:59,286 --> 00:33:01,965
﻿There is. There is.

281
00:33:02,046 --> 00:33:07,125
Let's go to the palace first.
Then my brother will show you that cure.

282
00:33:10,286 --> 00:33:14,485
﻿So? Will you talk to Gonca Hatun?

283
00:33:16,526 --> 00:33:21,325
﻿Would I ever give you a secret, sister?
-Brother!

284
00:33:22,406 --> 00:33:27,005
﻿I will die of curiosity! Brother!

285
00:33:50,486 --> 00:33:54,005
﻿Orhan... What are you doing here?

286
00:33:54,086 --> 00:33:56,925
﻿I was looking for you.

287
00:33:57,206 --> 00:34:00,245
﻿You raided my caravan when you last did that.

288
00:34:00,326 --> 00:34:03,205
﻿And you always remember
the worst, Lord's daughter.

289
00:34:03,446 --> 00:34:08,324
﻿But I will make you forget
all your bad memories now.

290
00:34:13,166 --> 00:34:18,165
﻿How will that happen?
-I will take you somewhere.

291
00:34:18,326 --> 00:34:21,485
﻿Will you come with me?

292
00:34:22,446 --> 00:34:27,205
﻿I have to go to the marketplace. I am late.
-You will not be late, Holofira.

293
00:34:27,966 --> 00:34:33,965
﻿When you see the place we will go,
you will thank me for taking you there.

294
00:34:37,485 --> 00:34:40,844
﻿Orhan...

295
00:34:40,966 --> 00:34:45,205
﻿You will not stop, huh? Gokmen...

296
00:34:45,406 --> 00:34:49,965
﻿Wait for me here.
-Yes my Shahzade.

297
00:35:00,286 --> 00:35:02,885
﻿Where are we going?

298
00:35:03,046 --> 00:35:06,925
﻿You will see when we go there. Be patient.

299
00:35:11,726 --> 00:35:14,405
﻿Konur tell me... Is the
way to Bursa closed now?

300
00:35:14,446 --> 00:35:17,925
﻿Two caravans were hit, my Bey. One
of them had weapons and equipment...

301
00:35:17,926 --> 00:35:20,157
﻿..the other one was
carrying supplies. The way of

302
00:35:20,169 --> 00:35:22,325
Iznik was surrounded
starting from the mountains.

303
00:35:22,326 --> 00:35:26,645
-No support units can come from there, my Bey.
-We will move as soon as possible.

304
00:35:26,806 --> 00:35:29,525
﻿Mongols are behind us. Or else...

305
00:35:29,606 --> 00:35:35,565
﻿..we will feel the dagger behind us before
we are able to turn our faces to the east.

306
00:35:37,126 --> 00:35:43,365
﻿Kite is not strong enough, my Bey...
But we have been stronger before as well.

307
00:35:43,886 --> 00:35:46,845
﻿We can defeat them with a sudden attack.

308
00:35:46,926 --> 00:35:53,005
﻿As Alps attack the right-wing, the
Bannerless will attack the left-wing.

309
00:36:07,406 --> 00:36:09,925
﻿What happened?

310
00:36:13,566 --> 00:36:17,565
﻿Gurbuz? What happened?

311
00:36:17,726 --> 00:36:22,005
﻿My Bey, Mongols were here.
They attacked one caravan.

312
00:36:22,126 --> 00:36:26,085
﻿We attacked behind them
but we couldn't succeed.

313
00:36:26,246 --> 00:36:30,405
﻿We're all right but Gurbuz
brother is not well, my Bey.

314
00:36:30,486 --> 00:36:34,805
﻿What are you saying? Gurbuz?

315
00:36:34,926 --> 00:36:39,205
﻿You'll be all right.
Take him to the infirmary now.

316
00:36:39,726 --> 00:36:42,965
﻿Alps, come on. Bismillah.

317
00:36:43,726 --> 00:36:46,805
﻿Alps and Bannerless ones will be with you.

318
00:36:46,886 --> 00:36:49,445
﻿-You'll be leading them all, Konur.
-Yes, my Bey.

319
00:36:49,566 --> 00:36:52,485
﻿Alps will come with me!

320
00:36:56,406 --> 00:36:59,405
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER
BORDER MARKET

321
00:37:03,606 --> 00:37:04,725
﻿Ayse Hatun.

322
00:37:05,926 --> 00:37:10,005
﻿She’s very talented.
She's her father's favorite.

323
00:37:10,446 --> 00:37:14,045
﻿No, I know that girl. She's spoiled.

324
00:37:14,286 --> 00:37:16,525
﻿She can't handle being a hatun of a bey.

325
00:37:16,646 --> 00:37:20,605
﻿What are we going to do Malhun?
You don't like any one of them.

326
00:37:20,686 --> 00:37:24,605
﻿Not that I don't like them. Wife of our child

327
00:37:24,726 --> 00:37:27,285
﻿will also be the mother of the state.

328
00:37:27,446 --> 00:37:29,725
﻿The state is not a place to mess around.

329
00:37:29,806 --> 00:37:34,245
﻿-Yes, I know that.
-Move on then.

330
00:37:39,726 --> 00:37:46,045
﻿Malhun Hatun, Bala Hatun, welcome.
Let me pour you some sherbet.

331
00:37:46,286 --> 00:37:50,245
﻿Thank you, daughter. We have a
lot to do. We'll visit another time.

332
00:37:50,406 --> 00:37:54,205
﻿Come, visit our shop. Come on in.

333
00:37:56,966 --> 00:38:02,125
﻿We don't want it, daughter.
We don't have time.

334
00:38:08,446 --> 00:38:11,205
﻿Look at her. You can see it, right?

335
00:38:11,246 --> 00:38:14,205
﻿She’s trying to make us like her.

336
00:38:14,286 --> 00:38:17,365
﻿Everyone heard that
we are looking for a bride.

337
00:38:17,446 --> 00:38:19,765
﻿Young girls are excited.

338
00:38:20,126 --> 00:38:23,285
﻿You're right.

339
00:38:39,486 --> 00:38:42,565
﻿Only this one left. Aysima Hatun.

340
00:38:42,806 --> 00:38:45,365
﻿Her name comes from her beauty.

341
00:38:45,806 --> 00:38:49,125
She's pretty beautiful, Praise be!

342
00:38:55,006 --> 00:39:00,805
﻿See? She saw us but she
didn't approach as others.

343
00:39:01,166 --> 00:39:04,245
﻿It's clear that she is decent.

344
00:39:04,366 --> 00:39:08,765
﻿She knows why we are looking
at her and she's embarrassed.

345
00:39:09,366 --> 00:39:12,445
﻿So, what about this girl?

346
00:39:12,526 --> 00:39:16,485
﻿Aysima Hatun was one of the
first to open a stall in this market.

347
00:39:27,246 --> 00:39:31,725
﻿They are looking for girls for Shahzades.

348
00:39:33,966 --> 00:39:37,845
﻿-How did you get it mother?
-How do you think?

349
00:39:38,006 --> 00:39:42,365
﻿That tiny woman standing
next to them is matchmaker.

350
00:39:43,366 --> 00:39:47,005
﻿Go around the stalls, Ulgen.

351
00:39:47,486 --> 00:39:50,245
﻿Sure.

352
00:39:51,486 --> 00:39:54,205
﻿Osman broke his oath.

353
00:39:54,406 --> 00:39:57,725
﻿Approach Alaeddin further more, Gonca.

354
00:39:58,006 --> 00:40:02,005
Mother. They put us into the dungeon.
Don't you remember how were we?

355
00:40:02,126 --> 00:40:05,845
﻿We are all right, Gonca.

356
00:40:06,126 --> 00:40:11,485
﻿Approach Alaeddin.
Let's find out Osman's secrets.

357
00:40:15,446 --> 00:40:19,045
﻿Hurry up. Today

358
00:40:19,166 --> 00:40:21,965
﻿they are looking for girl for Orhan,

359
00:40:22,526 --> 00:40:26,045
﻿they will be looking
around for Alaeddin soon.

360
00:40:28,366 --> 00:40:31,565
﻿For Alaeddin?

361
00:40:38,006 --> 00:40:41,445
﻿Ah, mother!

362
00:40:44,646 --> 00:40:48,765
﻿It's for you, the daughter of the Lord.

363
00:40:54,326 --> 00:40:57,365
﻿Come on, here.

364
00:41:12,686 --> 00:41:18,485
You have surprised me a lot, Shahzade.
I wouldn't expect it from you.

365
00:41:18,766 --> 00:41:23,685
﻿I'll surprise you lot more, Holofira.

366
00:41:59,846 --> 00:42:03,325
﻿There’s one more thing.

367
00:42:08,286 --> 00:42:11,605
﻿Look at Shahzade Orhan.

368
00:42:12,326 --> 00:42:15,965
﻿You know too many tricks.

369
00:42:24,926 --> 00:42:27,525
﻿Lotus flower.

370
00:42:27,766 --> 00:42:30,405
﻿It's not like any other flower.

371
00:42:30,646 --> 00:42:34,445
﻿It's pretty hard to get.

372
00:42:38,206 --> 00:42:41,245
﻿Just like you.

373
00:42:55,526 --> 00:42:59,085
﻿Orhan.

374
00:42:59,606 --> 00:43:02,845
﻿It is so beautiful.

375
00:43:15,766 --> 00:43:19,325
﻿You know that it lives in the water, right?

376
00:43:19,406 --> 00:43:22,965
﻿It dies if you try to
plant it under the soil.

377
00:43:23,046 --> 00:43:26,085
﻿I know that.

378
00:43:26,286 --> 00:43:31,245
﻿And I do everything to keep it alive.

379
00:43:35,366 --> 00:43:38,805
﻿Do you know, Holofira?

380
00:43:40,806 --> 00:43:45,365
﻿That how much I love you?

381
00:43:51,726 --> 00:43:54,085
﻿Knowing it is not enough, Orhan.

382
00:43:54,206 --> 00:43:58,605
﻿It is, Holofira. It is.

383
00:44:00,046 --> 00:44:06,085
﻿But I want to know too. Is my love for you...

384
00:44:06,526 --> 00:44:11,165
﻿...mutual?

385
00:44:21,006 --> 00:44:23,525
﻿Is it not?

386
00:44:27,086 --> 00:44:30,925
﻿Your mother does not want me, Orhan.

387
00:44:31,406 --> 00:44:36,925
﻿And you can't go against your mother

388
00:44:37,006 --> 00:44:40,685
﻿for anyone.

389
00:44:42,366 --> 00:44:48,165
﻿You're right. I wouldn't go
against my mother for anyone.

390
00:44:50,046 --> 00:44:53,325
﻿But you...

391
00:44:56,366 --> 00:45:00,405
﻿...you are not anyone, daughter of the Lord.

392
00:45:08,966 --> 00:45:12,405
﻿You're dreaming, Orhan.

393
00:45:13,486 --> 00:45:17,445
﻿You will not be able to
go against your mother.

394
00:45:32,086 --> 00:45:37,645
﻿There will be a war between you and
your mother as soon as I say yes to you.

395
00:45:38,646 --> 00:45:43,645
﻿I cannot be the reason for this.
I can't.

396
00:45:45,206 --> 00:45:49,365
﻿-Come on, Andra.
-Holofira.

397
00:45:51,406 --> 00:45:54,365
﻿So you say that...

398
00:45:54,526 --> 00:46:00,205
﻿...if I convince my mother
if my mother says yes...

399
00:46:02,046 --> 00:46:05,485
﻿...you'll marry me?

400
00:46:06,046 --> 00:46:09,565
﻿We'll talk about it when it happens.

401
00:46:16,806 --> 00:46:20,725
﻿Oh, the daughter of the Lord.

402
00:46:23,886 --> 00:46:27,725
﻿Holofira will not be yours, Orhan.

403
00:46:28,166 --> 00:46:32,405
﻿I'll never let that happen.

404
00:47:05,446 --> 00:47:09,845
Praise be! Praise be!

405
00:47:09,926 --> 00:47:13,725
﻿Your stall is in order.

406
00:47:15,806 --> 00:47:20,365
﻿I can't see anyone else. Do you
handle these things all by yourself?

407
00:47:20,526 --> 00:47:25,725
I'm doing it all by myself. I can't entrust
the labor of my household to someone else.

408
00:47:28,726 --> 00:47:34,525
Aysima, I know you and your family.
You know why I'm here, right?

409
00:47:34,606 --> 00:47:40,325
﻿I know. You're looking
for bride for your son.

410
00:47:41,366 --> 00:47:46,245
﻿I want you to meet with my son Orhan.

411
00:47:46,686 --> 00:47:51,485
﻿What do you think, daughter? Do you want it?

412
00:47:58,406 --> 00:48:03,085
﻿Brother. I'm so curious.

413
00:48:08,606 --> 00:48:12,845
﻿I swear I'll not say it.
Tell me brother, come on.

414
00:48:14,166 --> 00:48:18,845
﻿No. You cannot make me talk, sister.

415
00:48:24,166 --> 00:48:27,485
﻿They forgot about me
even before they get married.

416
00:48:27,726 --> 00:48:31,125
﻿I'll be ruined if they get married.

417
00:48:31,886 --> 00:48:33,205
﻿be ruined.

418
00:48:40,926 --> 00:48:44,765
﻿Trickster Hatun, where are you going?

419
00:48:44,806 --> 00:48:47,085
﻿We're going to practice, my Shahzade.

420
00:48:47,086 --> 00:48:49,565
﻿-You mind your own business.
-Oh, look at that.

421
00:48:49,806 --> 00:48:54,325
﻿Yes. You mind your business, Doctor.

422
00:48:54,486 --> 00:48:58,805
﻿-Let's go, Cerkutay.
If someone gets hurt

423
00:48:59,806 --> 00:49:02,725
﻿...you will need a doctor.
Yes, Cerkutay?

424
00:49:03,046 --> 00:49:07,765
﻿No, I can't hurt Gonca
Hatun. She is so beautiful.

425
00:49:09,766 --> 00:49:12,605
﻿She is.

426
00:49:15,166 --> 00:49:16,525
﻿Of course, she is.

427
00:49:24,726 --> 00:49:27,325
﻿Cerkutay Alp.

428
00:49:27,686 --> 00:49:31,605
﻿How about Scholar comes
with us? What do you say?

429
00:49:33,406 --> 00:49:36,765
﻿Well, he can. Let's go.

430
00:49:36,846 --> 00:49:41,125
﻿We don't have much time. Let's go!

431
00:49:59,566 --> 00:50:04,405
﻿Stop. Stop!
Stop.

432
00:50:08,686 --> 00:50:13,085
﻿There was an ambush. Be careful.

433
00:50:31,686 --> 00:50:35,045
﻿This is a trap, alps. Alps!

434
00:50:35,086 --> 00:50:38,565
﻿They laid traps everywhere. Draw your swords.

435
00:50:43,606 --> 00:50:48,605
﻿They may have laid traps everywhere. Careful.

436
00:50:54,966 --> 00:50:59,205
﻿It seems Mongolian dogs didn't come
here only to attack the caravan, my Bey.

437
00:50:59,366 --> 00:51:02,605
﻿Obviously not. They
attacked. But the cart isn't here.

438
00:51:02,806 --> 00:51:05,525
﻿They intend to hide in the cart.

439
00:51:05,846 --> 00:51:09,485
﻿Where do you think they will attack, my Bey?

440
00:51:10,566 --> 00:51:13,765
﻿They got the cart. Look.

441
00:51:13,886 --> 00:51:17,765
﻿The food is here.
The gold is here.

442
00:51:26,406 --> 00:51:30,485
﻿They're going to attack. Tell me now.

443
00:51:30,766 --> 00:51:34,125
﻿What is that cart appropriate for?

444
00:51:35,406 --> 00:51:37,925
﻿For the market.

445
00:51:40,646 --> 00:51:44,205
﻿They're going to attack the frontier market.

446
00:51:51,806 --> 00:51:54,845
﻿Turahan!

447
00:52:05,446 --> 00:52:09,205
﻿-Turahan, are you alright?
-I'm good, my Bey.

448
00:52:09,286 --> 00:52:13,245
﻿-Aykurt, are you alright?
-I'm fine, Boran Bey.

449
00:52:14,246 --> 00:52:17,885
﻿-Alps, is everyone alright?
-We have a wounded one, my Bey.

450
00:52:17,966 --> 00:52:21,925
﻿-Take him to the heal house immediately.
-As you order, my Bey.

451
00:52:23,406 --> 00:52:26,165
﻿-Are you alright, brother?
-I'm good, my Bey.

452
00:52:29,726 --> 00:52:32,365
﻿They are one step ahead of us.

453
00:52:33,566 --> 00:52:36,765
﻿Come on, come on.

454
00:52:43,046 --> 00:52:48,005
﻿Come on, Gonca Hatun!
Take the shahzade down! Come on!

455
00:52:48,406 --> 00:52:52,045
﻿-You put me in the dungeon.
-And you call me a hypocrite.

456
00:52:52,606 --> 00:52:55,805
﻿Are you not? Ha?

457
00:52:55,926 --> 00:52:59,525
﻿-You keep confusing me.
-Is that why you are so angry?

458
00:53:00,526 --> 00:53:04,565
﻿Did you think I would forget?
Ha?

459
00:53:05,246 --> 00:53:08,645
﻿-You put me in the dungeon for no reason.
-I know you didn't forget.

460
00:53:08,846 --> 00:53:12,725
﻿But you know we had to.
If it were up to your father...

461
00:53:12,726 --> 00:53:15,885
﻿Don't talk about my father!

462
00:53:24,886 --> 00:53:29,485
﻿You put both my brother's
and Orhan Bey's lives in danger.

463
00:53:30,286 --> 00:53:33,365
﻿But we saved them didn't we?

464
00:53:38,846 --> 00:53:41,085
﻿Trickster Hatun.

465
00:53:41,206 --> 00:53:44,365
﻿Don't you underestimate me, Scholar.

466
00:53:44,886 --> 00:53:50,125
﻿Stop! We are training here not killing.

467
00:53:50,286 --> 00:53:55,325
﻿The winner for this training is
Gonca Hatun, my Shahzade.

468
00:53:56,006 --> 00:53:59,325
﻿Now you'll do whatever Gonca Hatun says.

469
00:53:59,446 --> 00:54:02,965
﻿Oh really? But that's not what
you said in the beginning, Cerkutay.

470
00:54:03,046 --> 00:54:05,885
﻿This is the rule of the game my Shahzade.

471
00:54:06,566 --> 00:54:08,805
﻿You say so?

472
00:54:13,326 --> 00:54:16,005
﻿Fine.

473
00:54:16,366 --> 00:54:19,405
﻿What do you wish Trickster Hatun?

474
00:54:19,966 --> 00:54:22,485
﻿Cerkutay.

475
00:54:23,886 --> 00:54:27,005
﻿If our Shahzade is a scholar...

476
00:54:27,206 --> 00:54:30,045
﻿...and a bookworm,

477
00:54:33,206 --> 00:54:36,325
﻿...read a poem for us then.

478
00:54:50,126 --> 00:54:57,485
﻿"What comes from you is gracious
to me. Either a rosebud or a thorn.

479
00:55:00,566 --> 00:55:05,325
﻿It's either life or a shroud.

480
00:55:05,726 --> 00:55:10,045
﻿Both your fire and light are gracious.

481
00:55:10,846 --> 00:55:16,565
﻿Both your sorrow and blessing are gracious."

482
00:55:41,686 --> 00:55:45,885
﻿You wait here, dear.
I'll introduce you to my son.

483
00:55:49,486 --> 00:55:52,805
﻿Orhan, welcome.

484
00:55:53,046 --> 00:55:54,274
﻿-Mother.

485
00:55:54,286 --> 00:55:58,005
I found a girl for you. Let
me introduce you to her.

486
00:56:01,086 --> 00:56:06,085
﻿-Mother.
-Orhan, do what I say. Come on.

487
00:56:21,886 --> 00:56:23,965
﻿Holofira.

488
00:56:29,846 --> 00:56:34,725
﻿-You don't look well.
-I'm good.

489
00:56:35,726 --> 00:56:39,485
﻿I'm good.
Very good.

490
00:56:44,326 --> 00:56:48,845
﻿Aysima, this is my son Orhan.

491
00:56:50,446 --> 00:56:55,045
﻿Aysima is dealing with this
stand, handling things on her own.

492
00:57:06,126 --> 00:57:10,645
﻿Orhan, I'm talking you.

493
00:57:16,846 --> 00:57:21,685
﻿Nice to meet you, Aysima.

494
00:57:32,846 --> 00:57:36,925
﻿Where are you coming from?
Which stand are you taking the goods too?

495
00:57:38,606 --> 00:57:41,685
﻿It's all written here.

496
00:58:10,086 --> 00:58:13,285
﻿We've brought Erlik Khan's wrath for you!

497
00:58:13,366 --> 00:58:16,365
﻿Nokers, attack!

498
00:58:16,566 --> 00:58:18,645
﻿Alps, take position!

499
00:58:18,806 --> 00:58:22,125
﻿-Come on, go to the tent!
-Hurry up!

500
00:58:35,326 --> 00:58:37,965
﻿-Fatma bring the swords, quickly!
-Malhun Hatun!

501
00:58:38,046 --> 00:58:42,245
﻿Mother, you protect the people.
I will respond to them, quickly!

502
00:58:42,326 --> 00:58:45,365
﻿Fatma protect yourself!

503
00:59:18,006 --> 00:59:22,885
﻿Cerkutay! Cerkutay! My son!

504
00:59:23,806 --> 00:59:27,725
﻿Cerkutay is missing. Our son is missing.

505
00:59:28,086 --> 00:59:30,485
﻿-Cerkutay!
-Son!

506
00:59:30,566 --> 00:59:33,285
﻿Cerkutay!

507
01:00:07,486 --> 01:00:10,645
﻿My son! Cerkutay!

508
01:00:10,766 --> 01:00:13,805
﻿-Cerkutay!
-Get inside!

509
01:01:14,166 --> 01:01:18,245
﻿Gonca!

510
01:01:24,126 --> 01:01:27,445
﻿-Gonca are you alright!
-I am alright.

511
01:02:02,926 --> 01:02:06,645
﻿-Malhun Hatun!
-Aysima!

512
01:02:10,846 --> 01:02:15,005
﻿Aysima!

513
01:02:17,326 --> 01:02:20,765
﻿Holofira!

514
01:02:23,846 --> 01:02:28,725
﻿Aysima! Aysima!
Quickly get up!

515
01:02:37,286 --> 01:02:39,965
﻿Cerkutay Alp is coming!

516
01:02:40,086 --> 01:02:45,525
﻿Where is Cerkutay!
Cerkutay!

517
01:03:17,406 --> 01:03:20,725
﻿Where are you?

518
01:03:54,846 --> 01:04:00,005
﻿-My son! Son!
-Cerkutay!

519
01:04:00,446 --> 01:04:04,845
﻿Break it.
Break it from here.

520
01:04:06,686 --> 01:04:09,485
﻿Am I becoming a martyr, father?

521
01:04:09,686 --> 01:04:12,645
﻿No, no, you are alright.

522
01:04:12,726 --> 01:04:17,365
﻿You are alright my valiant.
You will be alright, hold on.

523
01:04:17,526 --> 01:04:21,245
﻿You are alright, my valiant.

524
01:04:28,686 --> 01:04:32,645
﻿I will come back for you soon.

525
01:04:32,726 --> 01:04:36,125
﻿Fall back.

526
01:04:39,646 --> 01:04:43,925
﻿Do not let them get away!

527
01:05:04,806 --> 01:05:07,805
KUTAHYA
GERMIYAN PALACE

528
01:05:08,766 --> 01:05:14,525
﻿The fate of the Turks and
muslims in these lands..

529
01:05:14,766 --> 01:05:21,685
﻿Is bound to the decision that
will be made in the council tonight.

530
01:05:22,886 --> 01:05:24,885
﻿-Kanyumaz.
-My Sultan.

531
01:05:25,006 --> 01:05:29,445
﻿Grandness shows power.

532
01:05:29,646 --> 01:05:32,885
﻿Rugs and other gifts..

533
01:05:33,046 --> 01:05:36,165
﻿Shall be ready fit to our name.

534
01:05:36,246 --> 01:05:39,205
﻿As you command, my Sultan.

535
01:05:39,966 --> 01:05:43,285
﻿Those who can not praise
Osman's council enough..

536
01:05:43,406 --> 01:05:48,845
﻿Will understand that they are in
the presence of a Sultan tonight.

537
01:05:51,086 --> 01:05:54,765
﻿They will decide accordingly as well.

538
01:05:55,206 --> 01:05:57,845
﻿Kanyumaz.

539
01:05:59,126 --> 01:06:02,565
﻿Tell alps to be ready..

540
01:06:02,686 --> 01:06:08,085
﻿To act in any case.

541
01:06:45,726 --> 01:06:49,445
﻿This is the place, my Bey.

542
01:06:51,286 --> 01:06:56,405
﻿So this is the house of Hasan
Aga you have been saying.

543
01:06:57,086 --> 01:07:00,805
﻿He hasn't been seen after the ambush.

544
01:07:01,006 --> 01:07:05,165
﻿Alright, you go on your duty.

545
01:07:06,086 --> 01:07:09,605
﻿You think they are hiding in here, bey?

546
01:07:12,406 --> 01:07:16,805
﻿Let us strike at night. Let me ask for help.

547
01:07:17,886 --> 01:07:22,405
﻿No. No one will know.

548
01:07:22,566 --> 01:07:28,685
Only Allah and I shall know 
what I will do.

549
01:07:29,726 --> 01:07:33,165
﻿You stay near me, that's enough.

550
01:07:38,406 --> 01:07:41,405
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER
BORDER MARKET

551
01:07:41,846 --> 01:07:46,765
﻿Cerkutay, can you hear me valiant?

552
01:07:47,846 --> 01:07:51,605
﻿He can not.
He can not!

553
01:07:57,366 --> 01:07:58,865
My Shahzade, do something.

554
01:07:58,865 --> 01:08:00,365
Do something my Shahzade.

555
01:08:00,526 --> 01:08:04,005
﻿He will be alright.

556
01:08:06,286 --> 01:08:10,845
﻿Be alright, my valiant.

557
01:08:11,046 --> 01:08:15,565
﻿Be alright. Get up my
valiant, we will do great things.

558
01:08:15,646 --> 01:08:20,885
﻿I will teach you how to be an
alp. My valiant come on, Cerkutay..

559
01:08:25,845 --> 01:08:33,045
﻿Ulgen, don't overshadow your
heart. We will pray and aid him.

560
01:08:33,206 --> 01:08:37,885
-With Allah's permission, he'll be alright.
-I hope so.

561
01:08:38,566 --> 01:08:42,125
﻿Gonca Hatun.

562
01:08:42,966 --> 01:08:46,404
﻿Put this to the wounds, Gonca Hatun.

563
01:08:47,725 --> 01:08:51,805
﻿-Are you alright?
-I am alright.

564
01:08:51,886 --> 01:08:55,925
-You think this will work, Alaeddin Bey?
-If Allah permits...

565
01:08:57,246 --> 01:09:00,604
...it will work.

566
01:09:01,566 --> 01:09:05,765
﻿It has to work.

567
01:09:07,246 --> 01:09:12,604
What do you mean it has to Alaeddin Bey?
Aren't you a healer?

568
01:09:13,926 --> 01:09:20,125
﻿I am trying to find the poison Mehmed Bey.
I have to find it to prepare antidote.

569
01:09:23,725 --> 01:09:27,564
﻿Then hurry Alaeddin Bey.

570
01:09:29,486 --> 01:09:34,325
﻿Do not think that this ambush
has nothing to do with you.

571
01:09:34,406 --> 01:09:39,245
﻿You are the ones ruining unity.

572
01:09:39,725 --> 01:09:42,645
﻿Mehmed Bey.

573
01:09:43,406 --> 01:09:48,045
﻿Mehmed Bey, this is
neither the place nor the time.

574
01:09:48,926 --> 01:09:52,484
﻿Don't talk like that without knowing.

575
01:10:02,046 --> 01:10:06,645
﻿Bala, Alaeddin tell me what happened.

576
01:10:07,806 --> 01:10:11,925
﻿It is not good father. Not good.

577
01:10:13,726 --> 01:10:17,245
﻿My Bey.
My Bey.

578
01:10:22,686 --> 01:10:26,325
﻿My dear.

579
01:10:26,406 --> 01:10:28,685
﻿My Bey, do something.

580
01:10:28,806 --> 01:10:33,725
﻿My Bey, my son is dying in front
of me, he just called me father.

581
01:10:33,926 --> 01:10:37,565
﻿Will he say it again? Will
he say it again, my bey?

582
01:10:37,886 --> 01:10:41,845
﻿Cerkutay.

583
01:10:42,286 --> 01:10:47,125
﻿No, don't say it like that.

584
01:10:48,526 --> 01:10:56,045
﻿Cerkutay does not give up
that easily. Right my dear?

585
01:11:01,086 --> 01:11:07,805
﻿Look at me. Don't ever overshadow yourself.

586
01:11:08,126 --> 01:11:11,925
﻿Do you hear me?

587
01:11:12,886 --> 01:11:15,925
﻿Look at me.

588
01:11:16,966 --> 01:11:19,925
﻿Cerkutay.

589
01:11:21,646 --> 01:11:25,005
﻿Won't die.

590
01:11:26,686 --> 01:11:31,285
﻿-Cerkutay.. will not die.
-Will not die.

591
01:11:51,086 --> 01:11:54,405
Incompetent fools!
- Secret House -

592
01:11:54,486 --> 01:11:57,645
When I looked at your body, your hair...

593
01:11:57,726 --> 01:11:59,605
...your huge bodies...

594
01:11:59,686 --> 01:12:01,525
...and your words...

595
01:12:01,576 --> 01:12:03,645
...I thought you were real men!

596
01:12:08,726 --> 01:12:14,125
﻿Can your pathetic eyes
see me at first glance?

597
01:12:14,206 --> 01:12:20,285
﻿Ilkhanate is way more
powerful than your Rome.

598
01:12:20,846 --> 01:12:23,485
﻿There are different types of poison.

599
01:12:23,566 --> 01:12:26,365
﻿Do you think there is an antidote

600
01:12:26,606 --> 01:12:29,445
﻿for the poison in their blood?

601
01:12:33,086 --> 01:12:36,045
﻿Do not underestimate your enemy Karacelasun.

602
01:12:36,126 --> 01:12:39,445
﻿You have the smell of pride in your breath.

603
01:12:39,846 --> 01:12:42,925
﻿They got rid of us many times.

604
01:12:43,006 --> 01:12:45,045
﻿If you are so small

605
01:12:45,206 --> 01:12:47,845
﻿everyone looks big in your eyes, crusader.

606
01:13:01,206 --> 01:13:05,605
﻿I didn't attack the marketplace,
I spread terror among them.

607
01:13:05,766 --> 01:13:08,845
﻿I spat fire on them.

608
01:13:09,006 --> 01:13:11,765
﻿They'll wake up in fear every morning.

609
01:13:11,846 --> 01:13:14,325
﻿They will never be able to get better.

610
01:13:14,526 --> 01:13:20,405
﻿I don't care about what you did to them!

611
01:13:20,646 --> 01:13:24,405
﻿You said vengeance! Where is it?

612
01:13:24,566 --> 01:13:28,885
﻿Osman and Yakup are still alive.

613
01:13:29,446 --> 01:13:33,405
﻿What are you going to do now, Karacelasun?

614
01:13:36,486 --> 01:13:40,565
﻿Commander, Yakup Bey are
gathering with other Turkish Beys.

615
01:13:40,686 --> 01:13:45,085
﻿Our Nokers are searching we'll locate them.

616
01:13:47,006 --> 01:13:50,445
﻿Now we know what to do, crusader.

617
01:13:50,606 --> 01:13:53,925
﻿I promise by the presence of Jesus Christ,

618
01:13:54,726 --> 01:13:58,565
﻿we'll do it.

619
01:14:14,006 --> 01:14:17,045
﻿Is your bandage pressing hard,
do you want me to loosen it?

620
01:14:17,366 --> 01:14:21,925
﻿Astagfirullah Malhun Hatun,
I don't want to bother you.

621
01:14:22,646 --> 01:14:25,765
﻿You were so brave.

622
01:14:26,326 --> 01:14:30,725
﻿You risked your life for me,
of course it wouldn't bother me.

623
01:14:31,326 --> 01:14:33,365
﻿If you hadn't jumped in front of me

624
01:14:33,486 --> 01:14:36,005
﻿this wound would have been mine.

625
01:14:36,126 --> 01:14:38,845
﻿I'd do it again.

626
01:14:38,926 --> 01:14:41,725
﻿I’d never think about it, Malhun Hatun.

627
01:14:42,606 --> 01:14:45,525
﻿Thank you, my beautiful girl.

628
01:14:46,126 --> 01:14:50,365
﻿Come on, get some rest.

629
01:14:55,366 --> 01:15:00,645
﻿Malhun Hatun, Osman Bey is
waiting for you at the council.

630
01:15:08,806 --> 01:15:11,805
KUTAHYA
GERMIYAN PALACE

631
01:15:12,406 --> 01:15:17,245
﻿In the 99 Names of Allah Almighty

632
01:15:17,726 --> 01:15:20,085
﻿Who strengthened us and our country

633
01:15:20,166 --> 01:15:24,125
﻿for Whose cause we gave our lives,

634
01:15:24,446 --> 01:15:27,325
﻿open the council.

635
01:15:28,846 --> 01:15:32,845
﻿BismillahirRahmanirRahim.

636
01:15:36,006 --> 01:15:41,445
﻿The council has been gathered for conquest.

637
01:15:45,126 --> 01:15:48,405
﻿We have gathered in the palace

638
01:15:48,486 --> 01:15:53,885
﻿to confirm our well-known power.

639
01:15:54,206 --> 01:15:57,325
﻿Now, Beys. Each one of you

640
01:15:57,446 --> 01:16:00,965
﻿will take out your troops.

641
01:16:01,046 --> 01:16:04,205
﻿We'll move towards Byzantium.

642
01:16:08,686 --> 01:16:10,765
﻿Isn't Osman Bey here?

643
01:16:11,006 --> 01:16:14,525
﻿Osman Bey is drawing Mongols towards us.

644
01:16:15,926 --> 01:16:19,765
﻿He's acting on his own.

645
01:16:20,446 --> 01:16:25,165
﻿Furthermore, he withdrew his oath.

646
01:16:27,166 --> 01:16:30,365
﻿He has no place in the council anymore.

647
01:16:30,606 --> 01:16:35,125
﻿We shouldn't waste a brave
man like Osman Bey so easily.

648
01:16:37,446 --> 01:16:39,565
﻿If any one of you have objections

649
01:16:39,686 --> 01:16:43,405
﻿go and get ruined with him.

650
01:16:46,086 --> 01:16:50,045
﻿When it is about conquest,
if someone tries to take sides

651
01:16:50,126 --> 01:16:54,165
﻿I'd doubt the love of holy war in his heart.

652
01:16:59,246 --> 01:17:04,365
﻿Now, Beys. Each one of you
will unite under my banner.

653
01:17:06,446 --> 01:17:08,845
﻿Altogether.

654
01:17:08,926 --> 01:17:12,285
﻿We will make conquests together.

655
01:17:12,766 --> 01:17:15,845
﻿Are you with me?

656
01:17:19,526 --> 01:17:23,885
﻿-We are with you, Sultan Yakup.
-We are with you, Sultan Yakup.

657
01:17:24,446 --> 01:17:30,405
﻿-We are with you, Sultan Yakup.
-We are with you, Sultan Yakup.

658
01:17:30,806 --> 01:17:34,165
﻿We are with you, but...

659
01:17:34,806 --> 01:17:38,525
﻿But what? Karesi Bey?

660
01:17:44,766 --> 01:17:49,925
﻿You say that Osman drew Mongols towards us

661
01:17:50,206 --> 01:17:55,285
﻿but in the meantime you
plan conquests in West.

662
01:17:56,126 --> 01:18:01,165
﻿Are we going to be able
to fight on both sides?

663
01:18:02,366 --> 01:18:07,285
﻿What are we going to do if
Mongols come towards us?

664
01:18:07,606 --> 01:18:12,925
﻿Whoever cut the head will pay the price.

665
01:18:14,326 --> 01:18:19,765
﻿Mongols are not our problem for now.

666
01:18:23,326 --> 01:18:26,205
﻿So we will not get involved?

667
01:18:26,326 --> 01:18:29,285
﻿Did I cut that head, Karesi Bey?

668
01:18:30,846 --> 01:18:35,965
﻿This was not Osman's
first and it will not be the last.

669
01:18:36,126 --> 01:18:40,485
﻿We have saved him enough.

670
01:18:43,326 --> 01:18:48,765
﻿We will make conquests. We
will take everything Byzantium has.

671
01:18:48,846 --> 01:18:53,325
﻿With the power we gain
from it, we will turn to East,

672
01:18:53,606 --> 01:18:57,365
﻿to Konya.

673
01:18:58,166 --> 01:19:03,605
﻿Mongols are the problem
of tomorrow, not today.

674
01:19:08,366 --> 01:19:13,605
﻿Now, Beys. Send messengers to your lands.

675
01:19:13,886 --> 01:19:18,845
﻿All of the troops will unite under my banner.

676
01:19:20,286 --> 01:19:26,485
﻿We will ruin the infidels.
Our first target is Izmir.

677
01:19:36,606 --> 01:19:38,125
﻿Kanyumaz.

678
01:20:23,966 --> 01:20:27,725
﻿Come on, enjoy your food.

679
01:20:30,206 --> 01:20:33,565
﻿BismillahirRahmanirRahim.

680
01:20:38,606 --> 01:20:42,765
﻿Instead of attacking altogether

681
01:20:42,886 --> 01:20:45,725
﻿why are they attacking behind shadows?

682
01:20:45,846 --> 01:20:48,845
﻿They tried attacking
altogether many times, my Bey.

683
01:20:49,126 --> 01:20:52,245
﻿But we defeated them every time.

684
01:20:52,446 --> 01:20:58,365
﻿Orhan is right. If they come
towards us with an army, we will unite.

685
01:20:58,486 --> 01:21:02,205
﻿Which shield can stop the
arrow coming from a shadow?

686
01:21:02,926 --> 01:21:06,525
﻿Then why are they targeting
Frontier Marketplace?

687
01:21:07,046 --> 01:21:10,925
﻿They want to spread fear, my Bey.

688
01:21:11,166 --> 01:21:15,165
We are not afraid, it's alright,
but what about the people?

689
01:21:15,566 --> 01:21:20,765
﻿If they attack the marketplace today,
they'll attack infirmary or medrese tomorrow.

690
01:21:20,966 --> 01:21:25,725
﻿Then there will be fear in
the hearts of all of the mothers.

691
01:21:26,766 --> 01:21:30,245
﻿Fear is like a finger-grass in Muslim soil.

692
01:21:30,566 --> 01:21:33,525
﻿It never greens.

693
01:21:34,286 --> 01:21:38,645
﻿But if they try to make it green

694
01:21:38,726 --> 01:21:42,085
﻿we will never let them do that.

695
01:21:42,166 --> 01:21:44,645
﻿They know it very well.

696
01:21:45,646 --> 01:21:48,885
﻿They will not stop after the
marketplace raid, my Bey.

697
01:21:49,046 --> 01:21:54,245
﻿Right. They want to ruin us.

698
01:21:56,206 --> 01:21:59,365
﻿What’s the target now?

699
01:22:00,406 --> 01:22:03,045
﻿Or who?

700
01:22:03,526 --> 01:22:06,405
﻿Their target is clear.

701
01:22:06,606 --> 01:22:09,285
﻿The ones on the top.

702
01:22:09,566 --> 01:22:13,085
﻿Me and Beys.

703
01:22:15,726 --> 01:22:19,525
﻿And Yakup Bey.

704
01:22:25,766 --> 01:22:28,165
﻿Come on.

705
01:22:33,646 --> 01:22:38,085
﻿My father entrusted the marketplace
to me but I couldn't protect it.

706
01:22:38,246 --> 01:22:42,445
﻿I'll ruin those embarrassed
me against Orhan...

707
01:22:42,606 --> 01:22:45,685
﻿Calm down son.

708
01:22:46,006 --> 01:22:49,205
﻿They are not like anyone
else we've seen before.

709
01:22:49,326 --> 01:22:53,365
﻿They knew that your father is away
and they attacked the marketplace.

710
01:22:53,446 --> 01:22:56,605
﻿Maybe they were going to
attack my father, brother?

711
01:22:56,686 --> 01:23:00,325
﻿There's a blessing in every harm.

712
01:23:07,446 --> 01:23:10,445
﻿Tell me, where is Yakup Bey?

713
01:23:10,606 --> 01:23:15,125
﻿Who are you to enter our
tent without permission?

714
01:23:15,486 --> 01:23:18,485
﻿Where is Yakup Bey?

715
01:23:19,846 --> 01:23:22,605
﻿Stop, Mehmed!

716
01:23:29,046 --> 01:23:33,365
﻿What are you going to do with Yakup Bey?

717
01:23:36,526 --> 01:23:40,845
﻿Yakup Bey is the reason why
they raided the marketplace.

718
01:23:42,926 --> 01:23:46,805
﻿Tell me... -Osman...

719
01:23:47,326 --> 01:23:50,885
﻿My father is with the Beys.

720
01:23:51,246 --> 01:23:55,525
﻿He is not alone like you. Don't worry.

721
01:23:55,606 --> 01:24:00,765
﻿Mehmet Bey! Behave yourself,
or I will rip your heart out.

722
01:24:00,846 --> 01:24:04,605
﻿My son... Stay back.

723
01:24:09,046 --> 01:24:12,965
﻿Son..

724
01:24:14,846 --> 01:24:18,805
﻿It is not a regular army.

725
01:24:18,926 --> 01:24:22,165
﻿They can enter Yakup Bey's
100 thousand horsemen...

726
01:24:22,366 --> 01:24:27,165
﻿...and kill him, and you cannot
understand who did it and how.

727
01:24:27,446 --> 01:24:30,885
﻿Thus, tell me. Where is Yakup Bey?

728
01:24:31,326 --> 01:24:35,725
﻿Yakup Bey left to stop
you from dissuading Beys...

729
01:24:35,926 --> 01:24:39,445
﻿...and ruining the conquests.

730
01:24:40,006 --> 01:24:44,205
﻿That's why he set the war council far away.

731
01:24:44,366 --> 01:24:48,245
﻿Now... you are using infidels' game to...

732
01:24:48,326 --> 01:24:52,205
﻿...learn where my Bey is.

733
01:24:52,846 --> 01:24:56,685
﻿If I go back with empty hands...

734
01:24:58,446 --> 01:25:02,565
﻿...only thing that will come to the
marketplace will be Yakup Bey's dead body.

735
01:25:02,686 --> 01:25:04,885
﻿Know that.

736
01:25:11,566 --> 01:25:15,285
﻿My Bey! My Bey! Osman Bey!

737
01:25:15,526 --> 01:25:18,205
﻿My son.. -My Bey...

738
01:25:18,446 --> 01:25:23,525
﻿The injured ones are dying one
by one. They are all poisoned.

739
01:25:24,126 --> 01:25:26,645
﻿What?

740
01:25:28,526 --> 01:25:30,805
﻿I tried everything!

741
01:25:31,046 --> 01:25:34,485
﻿But I couldn't find the antidote, my Bey.

742
01:25:34,646 --> 01:25:37,045
﻿My son...

743
01:25:38,606 --> 01:25:43,805
﻿Cerkutay! Won't Cerkutay survive?

744
01:25:50,206 --> 01:25:54,325
﻿Cerkutay...

745
01:26:01,966 --> 01:26:04,765
﻿I am slowing it.

746
01:26:05,646 --> 01:26:08,845
﻿First, their veins get bigger.

747
01:26:09,166 --> 01:26:11,805
﻿Then their heart starts beating faster.

748
01:26:12,206 --> 01:26:15,645
﻿Those who have a deep wound die sooner...

749
01:26:16,566 --> 01:26:20,045
﻿...and the ones who are lightly
injured die slowly, my Bey.

750
01:26:20,166 --> 01:26:22,394
﻿My Allah, protect our children.

751
01:26:22,406 --> 01:26:24,925
Send news to all
cities around us!

752
01:26:25,086 --> 01:26:29,925
﻿I want most talented doctors to
be in the frontiers marketplace!

753
01:26:36,286 --> 01:26:38,565
﻿Gonca! Gonca!

754
01:26:38,686 --> 01:26:42,525
﻿Gonca! Gonca! What happened?
-Gonca Hatun...

755
01:26:43,406 --> 01:26:47,085
﻿Gonca! Gonca... What happened?

756
01:26:48,646 --> 01:26:50,765
﻿Come on, let's take her inside.

757
01:26:50,966 --> 01:26:53,565
﻿Come on... Slowly..

758
01:26:53,646 --> 01:26:56,925
﻿Gonca! My daughter.. -Slowly.

759
01:26:57,046 --> 01:27:01,205
﻿Gonca! -Brother..

760
01:27:01,646 --> 01:27:06,165
﻿Brother, pull yourself together!

761
01:27:08,246 --> 01:27:12,525
﻿The ointment., we need the ointment.

762
01:27:12,846 --> 01:27:15,845
﻿come.

763
01:27:18,926 --> 01:27:21,725
﻿If you gave that gold to Mongols with...

764
01:27:21,726 --> 01:27:25,725
﻿...your honour and glory, we
wouldn't be going through this.

765
01:27:26,206 --> 01:27:29,925
﻿I will kill you Osman!

766
01:27:35,646 --> 01:27:39,325
﻿My son... You are a strong valiant.

767
01:27:39,646 --> 01:27:43,845
﻿But... I am also patient.

768
01:27:44,446 --> 01:27:47,765
﻿Don't you test my patience.

769
01:27:48,286 --> 01:27:50,845
﻿My son..

770
01:27:51,086 --> 01:27:55,525
﻿Now tell me where your
father is. If you don't..

771
01:27:55,646 --> 01:27:58,565
﻿...all the pain we've suffered from...

772
01:27:58,886 --> 01:28:04,285
﻿...will only be the beginning of the
pain we will suffer from in the future.

773
01:28:11,166 --> 01:28:13,645
﻿Come on.

774
01:28:14,606 --> 01:28:18,325
﻿Tell me.

775
01:28:28,926 --> 01:28:32,845
﻿Search everywhere!

776
01:28:34,086 --> 01:28:37,085
﻿Are you sure, my Bey?

777
01:28:38,406 --> 01:28:41,725
﻿This is the only place we
do not know the owner of.

778
01:28:42,086 --> 01:28:45,365
﻿They should search everywhere.

779
01:28:46,366 --> 01:28:49,165
﻿I think something is here.

780
01:28:54,126 --> 01:28:58,005
﻿Bayindir Bey, we looked
everywhere. The house is clean.

781
01:29:04,526 --> 01:29:07,045
﻿It's clean, my Bey.

782
01:30:07,406 --> 01:30:11,725
﻿Allah Allah.. What are you doing?

783
01:30:15,366 --> 01:30:18,645
﻿Bayindir Bey?

784
01:30:19,086 --> 01:30:22,005
﻿What happened? -Ayhan Agha..

785
01:30:22,566 --> 01:30:27,245
﻿What happened? What are you doing here?

786
01:30:33,526 --> 01:30:36,125
﻿My Bayindir Bey..

787
01:30:36,926 --> 01:30:39,845
﻿How can I explain?

788
01:30:40,366 --> 01:30:44,405
﻿Alps... Go out, Alps.

789
01:30:46,806 --> 01:30:50,885
﻿My Bey, let me stay with you.
-I said go.

790
01:31:01,926 --> 01:31:05,805
﻿My Bayindir Bey, you are a talented Bey.

791
01:31:05,926 --> 01:31:09,125
﻿I am saying this with all my heart.

792
01:31:14,006 --> 01:31:16,685
﻿You found..

793
01:31:16,806 --> 01:31:21,685
﻿...what no one could know and find.

794
01:31:22,006 --> 01:31:25,405
﻿What are you saying, Ayhan Agha?

795
01:31:35,206 --> 01:31:38,565
﻿Oh well..

796
01:31:40,326 --> 01:31:42,805
﻿Come, Bayindir Bey.

797
01:32:02,126 --> 01:32:08,845
﻿Ayhan Agha... Do you hide your gold here?

798
01:32:09,486 --> 01:32:14,685
﻿A part of it, let's say. A little part of it.

799
01:32:15,326 --> 01:32:18,165
﻿May Allah give you more.

800
01:32:20,686 --> 01:32:23,925
﻿One cannot believe.

801
01:32:24,686 --> 01:32:28,285
﻿Although you were talented enough to...

802
01:32:28,406 --> 01:32:31,245
﻿...solve my secret...

803
01:32:31,366 --> 01:32:36,005
﻿...how could they attempt getting
rid of you with a single doubt?

804
01:32:36,126 --> 01:32:39,805
﻿That's why I am feeling sorry.

805
01:32:41,526 --> 01:32:46,125
﻿Do not worry about that, Ayhan Agha.

806
01:32:46,606 --> 01:32:50,005
﻿You should worry about
how you are going to answer...

807
01:32:50,206 --> 01:32:54,285
﻿...for all this gold and
money on the other side.

808
01:32:54,806 --> 01:32:58,125
﻿I had the same problem in the past.

809
01:32:58,486 --> 01:33:02,725
﻿I gave all of it to other
people and found peace.

810
01:33:03,326 --> 01:33:06,165
﻿Thanks to Allah.

811
01:33:11,006 --> 01:33:15,005
﻿My Bayindir Bey. This gold..

812
01:33:15,326 --> 01:33:20,965
﻿...is halal for me just like my
deceased mother's milk was.

813
01:33:21,366 --> 01:33:24,005
Praise be.

814
01:33:24,486 --> 01:33:29,125
﻿But still, I am afraid.
That's another issue.

815
01:33:32,206 --> 01:33:36,645
﻿And about the questioning... The
actual people who need to give answers...

816
01:33:36,846 --> 01:33:39,685
﻿..are the ones who asked for...

817
01:33:39,806 --> 01:33:42,085
﻿...the head of a valiant like you...

818
01:33:42,166 --> 01:33:44,457
﻿...with a slander. I am
worried about them and

819
01:33:44,469 --> 01:33:46,725
how they are going to
answer on the other side!

820
01:33:53,966 --> 01:33:57,685
Heal... Heal him, my Allah..

821
01:33:58,326 --> 01:34:01,365
﻿Heal my son...

822
01:34:02,006 --> 01:34:05,965
﻿I have no One to ask
help from, except for You.

823
01:34:18,726 --> 01:34:22,165
Peace be upon you.

824
01:34:26,526 --> 01:34:28,925
﻿Dervish Efendi.

825
01:34:29,046 --> 01:34:33,365
﻿May he recover soon. How is he?

826
01:34:33,606 --> 01:34:36,685
﻿They couldn't find the cure.

827
01:34:37,926 --> 01:34:41,725
﻿I am losing my son and I cannot do anything.

828
01:34:42,326 --> 01:34:46,845
﻿Everything that comes comes from Allah.

829
01:34:47,286 --> 01:34:51,485
﻿Now we are struggling with this difficulty...

830
01:34:51,806 --> 01:34:54,325
﻿...but there must be a reason.

831
01:34:54,606 --> 01:34:59,045
﻿He is Dhul Jalal-i Wal Ikram (The
One of Majesty and Benevolence)

832
01:34:59,486 --> 01:35:04,085
﻿He first warns with His Majesty...

833
01:35:04,646 --> 01:35:08,845
﻿...then He offers with His Benevolence.

834
01:35:09,286 --> 01:35:13,765
﻿We never know, He is the One Who knows.

835
01:35:17,486 --> 01:35:22,085
﻿What am I going to do with
this pain, Dervish Efendi?

836
01:35:23,406 --> 01:35:25,845
﻿I don't know what I am going to do.

837
01:35:38,086 --> 01:35:41,525
﻿Holy Quran says:

838
01:35:41,646 --> 01:35:46,445
﻿"And know that your
wealth and your children...

839
01:35:46,566 --> 01:35:50,965
﻿...are only a test...

840
01:35:52,526 --> 01:35:55,805
﻿...and that with Allah...

841
01:35:56,006 --> 01:35:59,925
...is a great reward." 
[8:28]

842
01:36:01,166 --> 01:36:03,445
﻿Children are one of...

843
01:36:03,526 --> 01:36:06,725
﻿...the biggest tests.

844
01:36:06,886 --> 01:36:11,765
﻿How am I going to resist?
How am I going to be patient?

845
01:36:12,086 --> 01:36:14,485
﻿By looking at those who...

846
01:36:14,726 --> 01:36:18,765
﻿...experienced the heaviest tests.

847
01:36:18,926 --> 01:36:23,565
Prophets, Messengers...

848
01:36:24,486 --> 01:36:29,005
﻿For instance, Hadhrat Ibrahim (A.S.)...

849
01:36:29,686 --> 01:36:34,725
﻿He was tested with childlessness for years.

850
01:36:34,846 --> 01:36:38,525
﻿He resisted. Then Allah...

851
01:36:38,766 --> 01:36:42,965
﻿...gave him Hadhrat Ismael
(A.S.) and Hadhrat Ishak (A.S.).

852
01:36:43,166 --> 01:36:48,805
﻿But the test was not over. Hadhrat Ibrahim...

853
01:36:49,366 --> 01:36:54,605
﻿...had promised Allah that he
would sacrifice his son Ismael for Him.

854
01:36:54,766 --> 01:36:59,445
﻿Prophet Ibrahim (A.S.) was split
between Hadhrat Ismael (A.S.)...

855
01:37:00,166 --> 01:37:04,085
﻿...and the promise he gave to Allah.

856
01:37:05,446 --> 01:37:09,885
﻿And he surrendered against such a great test.

857
01:37:10,406 --> 01:37:13,485
﻿He was so surrendered...

858
01:37:13,566 --> 01:37:16,805
﻿...that he put the knife on the
neck of Hadhrat Ismael (A.S.).

859
01:37:18,166 --> 01:37:21,165
﻿And the test of Hadhrat Ismael (A.S.)---

860
01:37:21,286 --> 01:37:26,365
﻿...was to show loyalty to
the promise his father gave.

861
01:37:27,286 --> 01:37:30,405
﻿He was so faithful that..

862
01:37:30,526 --> 01:37:33,565
﻿...he put his neck on his father's knife.

863
01:37:33,766 --> 01:37:38,205
﻿You know what happened afterwards.

864
01:37:38,926 --> 01:37:44,045
﻿My Allah sent a ram from the sky as a gift.

865
01:37:44,286 --> 01:37:49,445
﻿First Jalaal, then Jamaal.

866
01:37:51,046 --> 01:37:52,805
﻿Hadhrat Jacob (A.S.)...

867
01:37:53,846 --> 01:37:58,805
﻿He was tested with the longing
of Hadhrat Joseph (A.S.)...

868
01:37:59,166 --> 01:38:04,605
﻿...and also the longing
of his other children.

869
01:38:04,966 --> 01:38:08,525
He was patient. Then...

870
01:38:08,886 --> 01:38:12,085
The messenger of Allah(PBUH).

871
01:38:12,806 --> 01:38:16,045
﻿Our Prophet who was sent
to the worlds as Allah's mercy.

872
01:38:16,206 --> 01:38:22,245
﻿He saw all his children die
except Hadhrat Fatimah (R.Ag).

873
01:38:22,646 --> 01:38:25,765
﻿He put them all in the graves.

874
01:38:28,126 --> 01:38:31,365
﻿Even he endured the suffering.

875
01:38:32,446 --> 01:38:38,205
﻿Prophets knew the life, all the gifts,

876
01:38:39,206 --> 01:38:43,165
﻿...the goods and even the children...

877
01:38:43,646 --> 01:38:46,565
﻿...came from Allah..

878
01:38:47,006 --> 01:38:50,245
﻿...and they would return to Him again.

879
01:38:50,606 --> 01:38:55,925
﻿Now you should follow
the path of Prophets now.

880
01:38:56,566 --> 01:38:59,165
﻿Pray with patience.

881
01:38:59,366 --> 01:39:03,925
﻿Don't you be one of those who cry out

882
01:39:05,206 --> 01:39:09,565
﻿Those who cry out against
the troubles have always lost.

883
01:39:10,166 --> 01:39:15,525
﻿Those who pray with patience
have always won in the both worlds.

884
01:39:15,686 --> 01:39:19,325
﻿Well, patience doesn't mean...

885
01:39:19,646 --> 01:39:23,365
﻿...just waiting with tears.

886
01:39:26,606 --> 01:39:29,085
﻿Well, we all pray.

887
01:39:29,286 --> 01:39:34,485
﻿The most appropriate
prayer is the prayer with effort.

888
01:39:35,246 --> 01:39:40,005
﻿It means... You demand the heal from Allah.

889
01:39:40,366 --> 01:39:45,885
﻿But you also need to seek
heal. Seek it inside you.

890
01:39:46,446 --> 01:39:51,525
﻿And to do this, you need
to remember yourself first.

891
01:39:52,286 --> 01:39:56,725
﻿Who were you?

892
01:40:00,686 --> 01:40:03,605
﻿Who was I?

893
01:40:06,886 --> 01:40:09,165
﻿I was Cerkutay.

894
01:40:09,446 --> 01:40:13,365
Cer... an Alp.

895
01:40:14,366 --> 01:40:18,965
I don't know about healing.
I'm not a doctor.

896
01:40:19,766 --> 01:40:22,525
﻿I'm not saying you are a doctor.

897
01:40:22,566 --> 01:40:28,445
﻿I'm saying... Just find yourself.

898
01:40:34,046 --> 01:40:38,365
﻿A child is a father's secret.

899
01:40:38,646 --> 01:40:43,085
﻿Look at your secret and find the truth.

900
01:40:43,566 --> 01:40:47,725
﻿The heal always lies within the truth.

901
01:40:48,366 --> 01:40:51,605
﻿Find it.

902
01:40:54,766 --> 01:41:00,125
﻿My brother sent this. He told you
to clean the wound and apply this.

903
01:41:04,726 --> 01:41:08,045
﻿How did she endure this pain for so long?

904
01:41:10,966 --> 01:41:13,005
﻿She doesn't talk.

905
01:41:14,446 --> 01:41:16,805
﻿She never talks to anyone.

906
01:41:17,446 --> 01:41:20,205
﻿She cures her own wounds.

907
01:41:20,726 --> 01:41:26,005
﻿My Allah, spare my child's life for me.

908
01:41:27,066 --> 01:41:28,435
Amen.

909
01:41:29,166 --> 01:41:32,885
﻿Gonca will be alright,
Saadet Hatun. Don't be afraid.

910
01:41:33,006 --> 01:41:38,325
﻿With Allah's will, everybody will be
alright. We'll do whatever Alaaddin said.

911
01:41:38,526 --> 01:41:43,245
﻿You heard Alaaddin. He said no.

912
01:41:44,126 --> 01:41:47,485
﻿He said he can't find the cure.

913
01:41:52,326 --> 01:41:56,885
﻿Bala Hatun, what will I do now?

914
01:41:57,886 --> 01:42:03,485
﻿The cure comes from Allah.
We'll find it with Allah's will.

915
01:42:16,366 --> 01:42:21,285
﻿Kismet, her fever is going
up. Prepare water with vinegar.

916
01:42:37,886 --> 01:42:41,205
﻿We'll be ahead of them when the sun arises.

917
01:42:41,806 --> 01:42:45,725
﻿You'll be leading the
catapults. Gurbuz, Hasan.

918
01:42:48,446 --> 01:42:49,925
﻿We'll have alps here too.

919
01:42:50,006 --> 01:42:53,365
﻿Heathens will think we're
outnumbered and they will attack.

920
01:42:53,566 --> 01:42:57,685
﻿When they attack, the
Bannerless will show up.

921
01:42:57,926 --> 01:43:01,525
﻿We and the Bannerless
will fight from two directions.

922
01:43:01,726 --> 01:43:05,805
﻿Yes, we'll surround the heathens.

923
01:43:05,886 --> 01:43:10,245
﻿We're outnumbered but the
Bannerless will change everything.

924
01:43:10,446 --> 01:43:13,525
﻿I didn't like them at first but...

925
01:43:13,846 --> 01:43:16,525
﻿...they'll solve an issue.

926
01:43:16,926 --> 01:43:22,165
﻿Yes, we wouldn't be able to
conquer without the Bannerless.

927
01:43:23,046 --> 01:43:25,965
﻿I'm glad the Bannerless are with us.

928
01:43:34,006 --> 01:43:39,245
﻿We aren't with you anymore.

929
01:43:42,966 --> 01:43:47,685
﻿We've drawn back our loyalty to Osman Bey.

930
01:43:48,366 --> 01:43:52,285
﻿We're starting the conquest
shortly. Are you saying this now?

931
01:43:53,566 --> 01:43:56,605
﻿It doesn't matter when, Konur Bey.

932
01:43:56,846 --> 01:44:01,805
﻿This is our decision. Now you conquer...

933
01:44:02,046 --> 01:44:05,445
﻿-And we loot again.
-You say so?

934
01:44:07,406 --> 01:44:12,205
﻿Are you showing your gratitude to those
who saved you from the heathens like this?

935
01:44:12,646 --> 01:44:14,405
﻿By betraying, ha?

936
01:44:14,486 --> 01:44:17,925
﻿We owe nothing to anyone.

937
01:44:18,326 --> 01:44:22,125
﻿We could have just gone
without informing, but...

938
01:44:22,326 --> 01:44:26,445
﻿...we just wanted to act nobly.

939
01:44:26,806 --> 01:44:28,725
﻿Nobly?

940
01:44:30,726 --> 01:44:33,565
﻿Look at those noble men.

941
01:44:34,166 --> 01:44:39,005
﻿You said you didn't want to be killed with
a vile dagger instead of becoming a martyr.

942
01:44:39,206 --> 01:44:41,605
﻿Now I see..

943
01:44:42,006 --> 01:44:45,765
﻿You just deserve to be
killed with a vile dagger.

944
01:44:48,966 --> 01:44:54,725
﻿We have no place for the betrayer
and the heartless in Osman Bey's army.

945
01:44:58,886 --> 01:45:01,565
﻿Now get out of here.

946
01:45:10,806 --> 01:45:13,725
﻿What are we going to do now, Konur Bey?

947
01:45:36,326 --> 01:45:37,965
﻿What's the situation?

948
01:45:38,086 --> 01:45:41,885
﻿Bey, the bannerless left the army.

949
01:45:42,086 --> 01:45:46,485
﻿Alps are not enough as well.

950
01:45:52,646 --> 01:45:57,125
﻿I took the initiative and stopped the
conquest, Bey. Alps are in the quarters.

951
01:45:57,206 --> 01:46:00,245
﻿So he acted in his nature.

952
01:46:00,326 --> 01:46:03,605
﻿Just as we accepted. Whatever.

953
01:46:03,726 --> 01:46:07,125
﻿It's better then them leaving in the war.
You mean..

954
01:46:07,566 --> 01:46:11,325
﻿Kite is waiting for its conquest you say.

955
01:46:13,326 --> 01:46:18,685
﻿Tell me, what did you do
since you stopped the conquest.

956
01:46:19,166 --> 01:46:23,605
﻿I put some alps around the Kite.
I increased the scouts around.

957
01:46:23,726 --> 01:46:27,405
﻿And I put the skilled ones inside as a spy.

958
01:46:27,446 --> 01:46:31,085
﻿Conquest has stopped for now,
but preparations are being made.

959
01:46:31,086 --> 01:46:32,165
﻿There..

960
01:46:33,006 --> 01:46:36,845
﻿That is the principle
that will take us to victory.

961
01:46:37,526 --> 01:46:40,205
﻿Not stopping even if we're at halt.

962
01:46:41,366 --> 01:46:45,485
﻿-Now where are we going, Bey?
-Those who hit the marketplace and alps..

963
01:46:45,566 --> 01:46:50,525
﻿Are after Yakup Bey. They
can not hit him at the palace.

964
01:46:51,366 --> 01:46:56,645
﻿Since we haven't received any
news they will hit him on the road.

965
01:46:59,046 --> 01:47:03,525
﻿Alps, quickly.

966
01:47:16,206 --> 01:47:19,965
﻿Soon the scouts will inform us
about the place of Yakup and Beys.

967
01:47:20,086 --> 01:47:21,765
﻿Five of you.

968
01:47:21,966 --> 01:47:26,365
﻿You will be after Yakup and Beys.

969
01:47:28,126 --> 01:47:32,805
﻿Aren't the Beys together, Karacelasun?

970
01:47:33,566 --> 01:47:37,205
﻿Why aren’t all of your men going there?

971
01:47:41,286 --> 01:47:44,725
﻿Where are the rest of your men?

972
01:47:48,846 --> 01:47:51,725
﻿You crusaders..

973
01:47:51,926 --> 01:47:56,245
﻿Are knowing Turks for a
hundred, maybe two hundred years.

974
01:47:56,766 --> 01:47:59,845
﻿We know them for a thousand years, crusader.

975
01:48:04,286 --> 01:48:07,045
﻿They stayed alive like
this for all these years.

976
01:48:07,126 --> 01:48:13,005
﻿Even if they clash on the inside, they
always unite against the outer enemy.

977
01:48:13,366 --> 01:48:15,645
﻿Meaning?

978
01:48:15,886 --> 01:48:18,965
﻿Osman will come to save Yakup.

979
01:48:19,206 --> 01:48:23,125
﻿The others already trapped the roads.

980
01:48:26,206 --> 01:48:29,805
﻿These woods are ours.

981
01:48:29,886 --> 01:48:33,565
﻿They will be a grave for all of them today.

982
01:48:40,166 --> 01:48:42,965
﻿Commander, Yakup Bey and others..

983
01:48:43,086 --> 01:48:47,725
﻿They are on their way back.
They are waiting for the army.

984
01:48:50,326 --> 01:48:51,325
﻿Bayci.

985
01:48:54,406 --> 01:48:57,365
﻿Bring me that poison.

986
01:48:58,326 --> 01:49:03,805
﻿Today we become a scorpion for Turks.
Let's take their heads before army arrives.

987
01:49:30,966 --> 01:49:34,085
﻿My Sultan.

988
01:49:36,926 --> 01:49:39,805
﻿What news do you bring from Iznik?

989
01:49:39,886 --> 01:49:42,885
﻿There is hard work going
on in Iznik, my Sultan.

990
01:49:42,966 --> 01:49:48,725
﻿The people and the soldiers
around the castle retreat into the wall.

991
01:49:48,966 --> 01:49:52,685
﻿The Lord is guessing the outcome..

992
01:49:52,766 --> 01:49:57,445
﻿-And preparing, is that so?
-Since he is taking many precautions..

993
01:49:57,686 --> 01:50:01,445
﻿He must've asked for
reinforcements as well, Sultan Yakup.

994
01:50:01,526 --> 01:50:05,925
﻿There won't be anyone
coming for help except Bursa.

995
01:50:06,966 --> 01:50:09,685
﻿And before the army
arrives from Constantinople..

996
01:50:09,926 --> 01:50:14,125
﻿The city will fall already.

997
01:50:17,406 --> 01:50:20,045
﻿Beys.

998
01:50:22,006 --> 01:50:25,645
﻿I want your armies at Iznik walls..

999
01:50:25,726 --> 01:50:28,565
﻿After three days.

1000
01:50:28,646 --> 01:50:31,045
Okay, Bey.

1001
01:50:32,326 --> 01:50:35,725
﻿With Allah's permission..

1002
01:50:35,806 --> 01:50:39,045
﻿We will honor Iznik with Islam..

1003
01:50:39,126 --> 01:50:43,965
﻿And stab our banner to infidel's chest!

1004
01:50:44,086 --> 01:50:49,605
﻿May we prevail! Quickly!

1005
01:51:35,846 --> 01:51:38,445
﻿Alps!

1006
01:51:43,086 --> 01:51:45,285
﻿My Bey.

1007
01:51:47,006 --> 01:51:51,485
﻿Don't fall. Are you alright?

1008
01:51:52,726 --> 01:51:56,285
﻿Take the shields.

1009
01:52:03,886 --> 01:52:05,845
﻿Bey..

1010
01:52:05,926 --> 01:52:08,445
﻿-There are traps.
-Exactly.

1011
01:52:08,486 --> 01:52:12,205
﻿-They know we went to Yakup Bey.
-Then let us move from another route, Bey.

1012
01:52:12,206 --> 01:52:14,885
﻿The other roads that go to
Kutayha has hills, my Bey.

1013
01:52:14,886 --> 01:52:17,645
﻿We do not have much time,
we will take the same route.

1014
01:52:17,806 --> 01:52:20,605
﻿So take your shields. Come on now.

1015
01:52:20,686 --> 01:52:23,525
Thank you. Now..

1016
01:52:24,166 --> 01:52:28,685
﻿Alps, we need to take the
Beys. We will take the Beys.

1017
01:52:28,846 --> 01:52:32,845
﻿Or our land will perish. Even if
martyrdom is at the end of this..

1018
01:52:32,966 --> 01:52:37,525
﻿We will walk. Quickly, help him.

1019
01:52:40,806 --> 01:52:43,885
﻿Quickly.

1020
01:53:11,086 --> 01:53:13,845
﻿Come on now.

1021
01:53:14,966 --> 01:53:18,365
﻿Alps, watch ahead.

1022
01:53:21,406 --> 01:53:24,565
﻿Quickly, quickly.

1023
01:53:31,126 --> 01:53:36,285
﻿Alps. There is a trap ahead.

1024
01:53:36,566 --> 01:53:41,205
﻿Quickly, this way, come.

1025
01:53:47,846 --> 01:53:51,645
﻿From here.

1026
01:54:14,086 --> 01:54:17,685
﻿Release the horses!

1027
01:54:19,206 --> 01:54:23,125
﻿There are arrows everywhere, Bey.

1028
01:54:23,966 --> 01:54:28,965
﻿-Alps, is everyone okay?
-We have two wounded, Bey.

1029
01:54:37,286 --> 01:54:40,165
﻿Alps..

1030
01:54:41,006 --> 01:54:45,005
﻿Seems it stopped. Let us move slowly.

1031
01:54:51,486 --> 01:54:54,565
﻿Gather around.

1032
01:54:54,726 --> 01:54:58,245
﻿We miss valiant enemies,
Bey. There are traps everywhere.

1033
01:54:58,326 --> 01:55:02,165
﻿Valiants do not know us as
enemy. These are just dogs.

1034
01:55:02,326 --> 01:55:06,325
﻿We have to reach the Beys
quickly. Bring the horses.

1035
01:55:09,486 --> 01:55:12,085
﻿Quickly. Come on.

1036
01:55:32,846 --> 01:55:36,525
﻿There will be a lot of blood.
The spirits of the trees..

1037
01:55:36,726 --> 01:55:39,925
﻿Will feast with blood.

1038
01:55:40,126 --> 01:55:45,205
﻿There will be blood of river, from dry lands.

1039
01:55:45,286 --> 01:55:48,525
﻿They will experience Erlik Khan's wrath.

1040
01:55:48,766 --> 01:55:52,845
﻿I will free my sibling's
soul, by having vengeance.

1041
01:55:52,966 --> 01:55:56,725
﻿It will be the end of the Turks. Quickly.

1042
01:56:19,046 --> 01:56:23,125
﻿My Sultan, these are our scout alps.

1043
01:56:23,206 --> 01:56:25,885
﻿Alps, stay alert.

1044
01:56:26,086 --> 01:56:29,885
﻿Alps! Stay alert!

1045
01:56:45,286 --> 01:56:47,805
﻿My Sultan!

1046
01:56:49,766 --> 01:56:53,565
﻿-Take cover!
-They are coming from everwhere!

1047
01:56:55,926 --> 01:56:59,325
﻿Where are these arrows coming from?

1048
01:57:12,326 --> 01:57:13,925
﻿Hang on!

1049
01:57:16,446 --> 01:57:18,485
﻿Stay together!

1050
01:57:35,446 --> 01:57:38,405
﻿When the smoke disappears, we will attack!

1051
01:57:38,566 --> 01:57:42,685
﻿Come on! My Bey! Come on!

1052
01:57:55,126 --> 01:57:58,165
﻿We are losing Alps one
by one. We cannot resist!

1053
01:57:58,366 --> 01:58:02,885
﻿We will resist Karesi Bey! We will!

1054
01:58:06,766 --> 01:58:09,445
﻿You forgot Ilkhanid's power!

1055
01:58:09,526 --> 01:58:14,085
﻿You became rebels when you had a
leader. Now you will lose your heads!

1056
01:58:14,326 --> 01:58:18,165
﻿You took my brother's head.

1057
01:58:18,446 --> 01:58:24,765
﻿And I will take your heads
with me everywhere I go!

1058
01:58:26,086 --> 01:58:30,405
﻿You cannot escape here you will die here!

1059
01:58:30,686 --> 01:58:33,445
﻿Come on!

1060
01:58:37,846 --> 01:58:40,845
﻿GERM1YANOGLU SIN1R1 / EC PAZAR

1061
01:58:45,966 --> 01:58:49,085
﻿He called me father.

1062
01:58:51,486 --> 01:58:55,925
﻿He will say it again, right, Ulgen?
-He will.

1063
01:59:00,246 --> 01:59:03,805
﻿You will get better soon..

1064
01:59:04,686 --> 01:59:07,565
﻿...I will do everything you say.

1065
01:59:08,166 --> 01:59:10,125
﻿My lion..

1066
01:59:11,886 --> 01:59:13,205
﻿My son..

1067
01:59:16,686 --> 01:59:20,005
﻿We will organize your circumcision feast.

1068
01:59:21,126 --> 01:59:24,045
﻿I will give you a horse.

1069
01:59:24,366 --> 01:59:29,205
﻿Hang on. Resist, my valiant.

1070
01:59:30,846 --> 01:59:35,005
﻿Don't be scared... He is like his father.

1071
01:59:35,646 --> 01:59:41,405
﻿He ate all those meals, a single
arrow won't be enough to defeat him.

1072
01:59:41,766 --> 01:59:45,685
﻿My Allah, let our son stay with us.

1073
01:59:53,126 --> 01:59:57,565
﻿He is still burning, he
has a high temperature.

1074
01:59:57,806 --> 02:00:01,405
﻿My Shahzade... Alaeddin Bey.

1075
02:00:01,566 --> 02:00:04,605
﻿He is still burning.

1076
02:00:11,086 --> 02:00:14,725
﻿His fever does not go down.

1077
02:00:23,286 --> 02:00:28,325
﻿Ulgen Hatun. Keep putting
on water with vinegar.

1078
02:00:35,126 --> 02:00:37,725
﻿My Shahzade..

1079
02:00:38,486 --> 02:00:42,445
﻿For the consent of Allah please heal my son.

1080
02:00:43,486 --> 02:00:49,205
﻿Cerkutay Bey... I will heal him.

1081
02:00:51,766 --> 02:00:56,445
﻿I know the antidote of Mongols' poison.

1082
02:00:58,166 --> 02:01:04,405
﻿But this is different...
This poison is different.

1083
02:01:09,686 --> 02:01:12,765
﻿Be patient.

1084
02:01:16,046 --> 02:01:19,765
﻿My Shahzade! My Shahzade!

1085
02:01:26,766 --> 02:01:30,805
﻿Let's turn him on his side.
-Bismillah.

1086
02:01:45,126 --> 02:01:48,925
﻿Indeed, to Allah we belong
and to Allah we shall return."

1087
02:01:49,566 --> 02:01:54,245
﻿No... It does not work.

1088
02:01:54,606 --> 02:01:56,485
﻿Nothing works!

1089
02:02:16,566 --> 02:02:19,365
﻿He will be alright.

1090
02:02:24,166 --> 02:02:27,045
﻿My Allah, help us.

1091
02:02:45,566 --> 02:02:49,685
﻿My beautiful daughter...
My Gonca..

1092
02:02:50,206 --> 02:02:53,125
﻿My rosy Gonca..

1093
02:02:53,966 --> 02:02:59,725
﻿Come on, open your eyes.
Come on, my beautiful daughter.

1094
02:03:01,926 --> 02:03:04,805
﻿I failed.

1095
02:03:05,326 --> 02:03:10,165
I couldn't protect her, mother. I couldn't
protect my father's entrustment.

1096
02:03:10,246 --> 02:03:12,805
﻿Mehmet!

1097
02:03:14,086 --> 02:03:16,725
﻿Pull yourself together Mehmet.

1098
02:03:18,526 --> 02:03:21,045
﻿Pull yourself together.

1099
02:03:21,126 --> 02:03:25,605
﻿My sister... If something
happens to my sister, mother...

1100
02:03:25,846 --> 02:03:28,285
﻿Nothing will happen to her.

1101
02:03:31,926 --> 02:03:36,085
﻿Your sister will get better and stand up.

1102
02:03:41,926 --> 02:03:46,365
﻿My one wing is injured and in blood, Mehmet.

1103
02:03:46,726 --> 02:03:50,765
﻿If something happens to my
other wing, what am I going to do?

1104
02:03:51,286 --> 02:03:55,485
﻿You will be strong and stand tall.

1105
02:04:14,526 --> 02:04:17,245
﻿Saadet Hatun.

1106
02:04:18,286 --> 02:04:20,685
﻿How is she?

1107
02:04:21,166 --> 02:04:25,085
﻿She is still unconscious.
But she will wake up.

1108
02:04:25,166 --> 02:04:28,725
﻿My beautiful daughter
will get better and stand up.

1109
02:04:30,526 --> 02:04:33,165
﻿She will.

1110
02:04:34,406 --> 02:04:39,085
﻿She is a brave woman. Gonca
Hatun is a fearless woman.

1111
02:04:39,966 --> 02:04:45,245
﻿She is very strong. She
will get over this for sure.

1112
02:04:46,366 --> 02:04:50,565
﻿Her mother's one and only
is strong, she is really strong.

1113
02:04:52,486 --> 02:04:57,365
﻿Your firmness will make
her firm, Saadet Hatun.

1114
02:04:57,526 --> 02:05:02,885
﻿Also, Alaeddin Bey is looking for a cure.

1115
02:05:10,446 --> 02:05:15,365
﻿-Soon he will find it.
-Thank you, Bala Hatun.

1116
02:05:15,646 --> 02:05:18,445
﻿Thank you.

1117
02:05:26,246 --> 02:05:29,125
﻿-Gonca, what happened?
-Saadet Hatun.

1118
02:05:29,606 --> 02:05:32,165
﻿-Gonca.
-Sister.

1119
02:05:32,406 --> 02:05:35,405
﻿-Gonca! Gonca!
-Let us take a look Saadet Hatun.

1120
02:05:35,606 --> 02:05:38,565
-Is she breathing?
-Turn her.

1121
02:05:38,766 --> 02:05:42,445
﻿Is she breathing? Gonca? Gonca?

1122
02:05:42,726 --> 02:05:44,885
﻿-Sister? Talk to me.
-Gonca?

1123
02:05:44,966 --> 02:05:46,085
﻿Open it.

1124
02:05:46,166 --> 02:05:49,565
﻿Is she breathing? Gonca?

1125
02:05:49,686 --> 02:05:53,445
﻿Sister! Gonca!

1126
02:06:05,046 --> 02:06:07,085
﻿Gonca?

1127
02:06:15,446 --> 02:06:17,885
﻿-Gonca!
-Gonca!

1128
02:06:18,046 --> 02:06:20,965
﻿Say something! Gonca!

1129
02:06:21,406 --> 02:06:24,165
﻿-Gonca!
-Gonca!

1130
02:06:24,286 --> 02:06:27,805
﻿-Gonca! Gonca!
-Sister!

1131
02:06:30,886 --> 02:06:36,805
﻿-Sister! Gonca!
-Gonca!

1132
02:06:59,086 --> 02:07:02,845
﻿Ulgen. How is the child?

1133
02:07:09,526 --> 02:07:15,245
﻿Don't cry. Be better so
he can be better as well.

1134
02:07:17,366 --> 02:07:21,525
﻿We will pray together.

1135
02:07:25,886 --> 02:07:28,605
﻿Cerkutay?

1136
02:07:29,686 --> 02:07:31,725
﻿Cerkutay, something's happening.

1137
02:07:31,806 --> 02:07:33,565
﻿Cerkutay.

1138
02:07:33,686 --> 02:07:37,325
﻿Son? Son? Cerkutay?

1139
02:07:37,566 --> 02:07:41,845
﻿What happened? What?

1140
02:07:42,046 --> 02:07:45,805
﻿Son? Son.

1141
02:07:46,126 --> 02:07:48,405
﻿-Cerkutay?
-He's not breathing.

1142
02:07:48,726 --> 02:07:52,245
﻿-He's not breathing.
-Alps!

1143
02:07:52,566 --> 02:07:55,885
﻿Alps! Call Alaeddin, now!

1144
02:07:56,206 --> 02:07:59,645
﻿Son? My son!

1145
02:07:59,726 --> 02:08:03,005
﻿-Calm down, calm down.
-My son!

1146
02:08:03,086 --> 02:08:05,605
﻿Cerkutay! Breathe, son!

1147
02:08:05,686 --> 02:08:08,965
﻿My son! Cerkutay!

1148
02:08:10,766 --> 02:08:14,965
﻿Cerkutay! Son! My son!

1149
02:08:15,166 --> 02:08:19,685
﻿No, no, no!

1150
02:08:21,486 --> 02:08:24,525
﻿No! My son!

1151
02:08:24,686 --> 02:08:27,325
﻿My Cerkutay, my son, please breathe!

1152
02:08:27,406 --> 02:08:30,605
﻿Cerkutay, breathe!

1153
02:08:30,766 --> 02:08:37,085
﻿No, no, no! Son! Cerkutay!

1154
02:08:39,286 --> 02:08:42,085
﻿Look, my son.

1155
02:08:43,166 --> 02:08:46,605
﻿Cerkutay, breathe! Cerkutay!

1156
02:08:47,126 --> 02:08:51,525
﻿Cerkutay! Cerkutay!

1157
02:08:53,206 --> 02:08:55,725
﻿What are we going to do?

1158
02:08:58,846 --> 02:09:02,765
﻿The smoke is clearing out, attack!

1159
02:10:10,166 --> 02:10:16,925
﻿Osman! You’ve come to death
before death comes for you.

1160
02:10:17,046 --> 02:10:21,165
﻿I'll destroy all of your
cities to avenge my brother!

1161
02:10:21,326 --> 02:10:25,285
﻿Your brother died you will die too.

1162
02:10:48,206 --> 02:10:51,445
﻿My Bey! My Bey!

1163
02:10:57,046 --> 02:11:01,645
The death will be after you all the time.
I'll come back for you soon.

1164
02:11:01,726 --> 02:11:07,965
﻿Anyone tries to destroy
Turks will end up dying!

1165
02:11:13,606 --> 02:11:18,245
﻿Nokers, retreat!

1166
02:11:32,806 --> 02:11:34,675
Allah is the Greatest!

1167
02:11:52,206 --> 02:11:57,685
﻿Alps! Go after them!

1168
02:12:09,366 --> 02:12:11,925
﻿Candar Bey.

1169
02:12:13,166 --> 02:12:15,445
﻿Candar.

1170
02:12:29,166 --> 02:12:34,805
﻿Candar Bey was poisoned.
He passed away, my Bey.

1171
02:12:35,726 --> 02:12:40,685
﻿Indeed, to Allah we belong
and to Allah we shall return.

1172
02:12:51,046 --> 02:12:55,085
﻿The swords used and arrows thrown...

1173
02:12:55,686 --> 02:12:58,565
﻿They were all poisonous, my Bey.

1174
02:13:18,686 --> 02:13:22,045
﻿Gonca! Gonca! Is she breathing?

1175
02:13:22,126 --> 02:13:25,285
﻿-Sister! Gonca!
-Cerkutay, breathe!

1176
02:13:25,566 --> 02:13:28,365
﻿Cerkutay! Cerkutay’

1177
02:13:47,217 --> 02:14:07,807
